<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">YOB</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hiob Kukũ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yob</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yob</para>
  <para style="mt2">YOB KUKŨ</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOB</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKIOTUO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Yob Kukũ</char> nle ɔlaa di osuɔtɔ biene onwii nianu ni dibuo di akpilesaa suoto osie kanya- babi nɔɔ bamuu lakpi, asaa nɔɔ amuu laloo, ofiɛ kpile onwii kafɔɔ lapɛ nwɔ. Ninfɛ di batii batiɛ lɛkakatɛ kamɛ yi, kukũ kpanatɛ letuo mmle di Yob basiɛwo ku Yob omu ladiki ni kɔkpaa di sɛlaa kpile se mmle suoto. Di kayɛntɛkɔ, Yaa omu wɔ di kasiɛ nɔɔ ku batii disiɛbi niabale ni lɛba finle di lɛkakatɛ nwu kamɛ labadiki suoto aatuo Yob.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yob basiɛwo ladiki dibuo nɔɔ kasɔ di okpoo batii sɛsaabla kasumu kanya. Ta beefũ beenu ni alɛ, di Yaa, obe lele anta ni dibiene letota, annanfi ni dikpilesaa kootoko yi, ni Yob dibuo nwu kotuo alɛ ɛɛbla okpile nɛ. Kafɔɔ Yob nnwɔɔ, nle mmle nnaa nwɔ osie saa; aasiɛko amumu letoko nanfi le mmle, diekye aale otii biene ku tininitɛ. Ni atanu kasɔ lɛsaa le oso di Yaa kata dikpilesaa kplɛ le mmle nwa ni di otii fɛ nnwɔɔ okle suoto, ni aakaalɛ Yaa ɔlaa nɛ. Yob ditayu ofũonu nɔɔ, kafɔɔ aatoonyu osuku alɛ asaa kamalɛ di Yaa anu, ankple anwɛ dibu nɔɔ fɛ otii biene.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yaa nindiki kanya di Yob sɛlaa kaalɛle suoto, kafɔɔ anfũ Yob ofũonu ankpee, anta nnɛɛ nfee nwɔ ku nnwɔɔ Yaa osie kplɛ ku lɛsaatofo nɔɔ le andiki antuo nwɔ ni di lɛkakatɛ nɔɔ kamɛ. Ninfɛ di suoto kasɔ ɔwakosa kamɛ, Yob ntofo Yaa fɛ numbentɛ ku nimuɔ nɔɔ, ankyi diɛ sɛlaa kplɛ ku sɛblɔlaa se atoobuɛ ɛɛbafe ni suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔlaa nwu kayɛntɛkɔ lɛkpana mmle baakplesa Yob letembi le aate ni saa baatɔɔ nii, bia ku asaa kplɛ ya nialenkee ni n-ya niawɛ nwɔ ni kofokofoko. Yaa lalɔnko Yob basiɛwo di mmle baasĩ batanu ni Yob dibuo nwu kasɔ. Yob lete niatɛ aatofo alɛ Yaa lemuɔ alenke okpoo batii kasumu lediki keetuo nwɔ nii.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ kamɛ sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛlaa se niale ni katũ <char style="ior">1.1-2.13</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yob ku basiɛwo nɔɔ<char style="ior">3.1-31.40 </char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Yob sikrudu owi<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-26">3.1-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Lɛkakatɛ kasale <char style="ior">4.1-14.22</char></para>
  <para style="io2">ɔ. Lɛkakatɛ nyɔɔfa <char style="ior">15.1-21.34</char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Lɛkakatɛ tiɛfa <char style="ior">22.1-27.23</char></para>
  <para style="io2">e. Di ninumbe katansa kamɛ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 28:1-28">28.1-28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">f. Yob sɛlaa yɛntɛle <char style="ior">29.1-31.40</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Elihu lɛkakatɛ <char style="ior">32.1-37.24</char></para>
  <para style="io1">SAATE nwu lakakatɛko Yob <char style="ior">38.1-42.6</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kayɛntɛkɔ sɛlaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42.7-17</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sɛlaa Se Niale Ni Katũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Osuɔtɔ onwii lawɛ di Us kasɔ suoto, leyooto nɔɔ niale Yob. Osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle ditawɛ ole kuonwii, aate kafɔɔ tinini; aayɛkɛ ni Yaa, aakyidi ni okpile kafɔɔ. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Aawɛ babisuɔtɔbi bakuɛnsĩ ku babisankobi batiɛ, <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />aawɛ kafɔɔ bafoso nkpe nkuɛnsĩ, kapu bapɔnkɔ nkpe ntiɛ, banankyue alafa anɔɔ ku bapɔnkɔ ba nintuka ni atoo alafa anɔɔ, aawɛ kafɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ kpinwu. Nnwɔɔ niale saawɛntɛ kplɛ di Kufĩ katunkɔ batii bamuu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ntɛ obe mantũ sipunu di ayo lɛma, manlɛɛ babilɛma-sankobi batiɛ nwu mamale, mannyi ku mma. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Nse opunu otumbee nwu ntoofe yi, Yob nkpee mankyɛ manaakleklesa ma suoto. Di kolesɛtũ anta ɔfiɛ asaaɔta oleɔta anta obiala lɛma, ku disibu alɛ, “Loobia babi nii lɛbla okpile, bɛɛkpaani Yaa di situ lɛma kamɛ.” Nle mmle niale Yob ɔsaabla obe lele nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yob Ɔsɔ Onyu Kasale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Dii ninwii Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ lawa baabadiki suoto baatuo SAATE nwu, Satana kafɔɔ lakyɛ ku mma. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Ni di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ Satana alɛ, “Ɔfɛ feekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Satana ladiki kanya, aatɔkɔ SAATE nwu alɛ, “Lɛkyɛ lɛlaakyikyii kasɔ suoto, lɛkyɛ lefe ka sitũ ku sɛmaa.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ Satana alɛ, “Feenyunyu kpɛmblatɛ nii Yob? Kuonwii nnaa kaasɔ suoto ate ni fɛle nnwɔɔ; ate tinini anaa ni ole kuonwii, otii wɔ ninyɛkɛ ni Yaa eekyidi ni okpile.”<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Ni di Satana ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kasakasa di Yob nyɛkɛ Yaa?” <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />“Diele kɔba feekpee feekyisa nwɔ ku leyo nɔɔ batii ku lɛsaa biala ninkpe nwɔ ni? Feewii nnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ ɔkpɛ lɛtɔtrɔ, alɛ bafoso ku banankyue nɔɔ lɛkyaka kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Kafɔɔ diki kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ faakpanko lɛsaa biala ninkpe nwɔ ni, alɛ nwaako, aakpaani fɔ di anu lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Satana alɛ, “Kulɛ, ni lɛsaa biala ninkpe nwɔ ni nsi fɔ ninnɛɛ, kafɔɔ tandiki lɛnɛɛ faakpanko otii omu nɔɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">Ninfɛ di Satana lakyɛ di SAATE nwu anu aasifi nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baawɔɔsa Yob Babi Ku Lɛsaawɛ Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Dii ninwii, di obe wɔ di Yob babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi latoole, baatoonyi ni di obilɛma-suɔtɔbi nɔɔfole leyo yi, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />tɔkyɛntɛ onwii lawa Yob nfũ aabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Banankyue letoofuu kasɔ, babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo kafɔɔ letoowee sɛfa di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma, <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />ni di Saba batii lɛbadieko ma, beemufũ ma beesifiko nɛ. Beelo bakpɛmblatɛ nwu ku kapamii, lete nii ninle nnwɔ nietoso ni nlɛ kɔbatɔkɔ fɔ ni nɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Obe wɔ eekple ayɛ ɔɔkakatɛ nii, tɔkyɛntɛ bamba lawa aababuɛ alɛ, “Yaa ɔtɔ lɛkpa kuokye kolo kuɔbafiɛ bafoso ku bakpɛmblatɛ nwu, lete nii ninle nnwɔ nietoso ni nlɛ kɔbatɔkɔ fɔ ni nɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Obe wɔ ayɛ ɔɔkakatɛ nii, tɔkyɛntɛ bamba lawa aababuɛ alɛ, “Kaldea batii lɛbla kayu akudi atiɛ bɛɛbatuka babɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ ba nintuka ni atoo beesifiko. Beelo bakpɛmblatɛ nwu ku kapamii, lete nii ninle nnwɔ nietoso ni nlɛ kɔbatɔkɔ fɔ ni nɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Obe wɔ ayɛ ɔɔkakatɛ nii, nfanwu, tɔkyɛntɛ bamba lawa aababuɛ alɛ, “Babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛfɔ letoole, beetoonyi di obilɛma-suɔtɔbi nɔɔfole leyo, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />ni di nfanwu, kɔfɛɛfɔ siene kunwii lekye ɔfaafuu kuɔbafɛ leyo nwu ayokɔ ana. Diebiɛ diɛpɛ ma, ni beekpi nɛ, lete nii ninle nnwɔ nietoso ni nlɛ kɔbatɔkɔ fɔ ni nɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Ta nle mmle oso, Yob lataka aabɛbɛɛ akpeele-wua nɔɔ, aakpaasu disi. Ninfɛ aase katũ kaasɔ aapɛ ɔlaa <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">“Lɛkyɔtɔ ladie di yaami olofofɔtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">lɛkyɔtɔ kafɔɔ kamakple nsifi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">SAATE nwu niɛta, SAATE nwu kafɔɔ niekple eefũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">baatansa SAATE nwu leyooto.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Di n-ya mmle amuu yi, Yob ditabla okpile alɛ ɔɔtɛ Yaa kolò alɛ atalolaa abla.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Ɔsɔ Onyu Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Di dii bamba, Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ lawa babadiki suoto baatuo SAATE nwu, Satana kafɔɔ lawa ku mma aabadiki suoto aatuo nwɔ. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ Satana alɛ, “Ɔfɛ feekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Satana ladiki kanya, aatɔkɔ SAATE nwu alɛ, “Lɛkyɛ lɛlaakyikyii kasɔ suoto, lɛkyɛ lefe ka sitũ ku sɛmaa.” <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ Satana alɛ, “Feenyunyu kpɛmblatɛ nii Yob? Kuonwii nnaa kaasɔ suoto ate ni fɛle nnwɔɔ; ate tinini anaa ni ole kuonwii, otii wɔ ninyɛkɛ ni Yaa eekyidi ni okpile. Eekple akle ditininii nɔɔ nwu, nu feekpee mi falɛ nnaawɔɔsɔɔ anambla ni lɛsalɛsaa.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Ni di Satana ladiki kanya alɛ, “Suoto kukũ diɛta ni suoto kukũ!” “Otii kamayɔ lɛsaa biala ninkpe nwɔ ni anta di nkpa nɔɔ mmu. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Kafɔɔ diki kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ faakpanko suoto nɔɔ ku akufi nɔɔ, nwaako abakpaani fɔ di anu lɛfɔ.” <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Satana alɛ, “Kulɛ, asi fɔ ninnɛɛ, kafɔɔ tandiki lɛnɛɛ faakpanko otii omu nkpa.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Nioso Satana lakyɛ di SAATE nwu anu aasifi, ni aalaatika nkɔ kpile di Yob suoto nɛ. Diayɔ ni di nkpaasɔ nɔɔ dialaase di nsintɛɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ninfɛ di Yob layɔ dibukii kakyɛɛ aatoofiɛlɛ suoto ku nka, di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni di ntɔ̀ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Ni di ɔsɔfɔ lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Feekple fakle okle tininitɛ ole lɛfɔ nwu? Kpaani Yaa, faakpi!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ, “Fɔɔkakatɛ fɛle ɔsanko buutɛ. Dibiene lete buafũ munkyeko Yaa nfũ, diele ku dibuo?” Di n-ya mmle kamɛ, Yob ditabla okpile di nnwɔ aabuɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yob Basiɛwo Batiɛ Lawa Ɔkyɛ Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Obe wɔ di Yob basiɛwo batiɛ ba niale ni Elifas wɔ niale ni Teman otii, Bildad wɔ niale ni Suhi otii ku Sofar wɔ niale ni Naama otii, lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ omuu niawa ni di suoto nɔɔ yi, ni baadie di ayo lɛma, baalaakyaka baabla kanya kanwii alɛ bɔɔkyɛ manaasɛɛsɔɔ mankpee nwɔ kɔnɛɛ kaafutu nɛ. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Obe wɔ baanyɔɔ ni di kakyonkɔ, sebe fiɛ baatofo nwɔ; ni baakye kasɔ baatoowi osie kanya, baabɛbɛɛ akpeele-wua lɛma, baakpete kɔtɛ di asi lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Ninfɛ baataba kaasɔ ku nnwɔɔ ayi akuɛnsĩ ku nkyɛ nkuɛnsĩ nɛ. Kuonwii ditafuo nwɔ ɔlaa kuonwii ɔtɔkɔ, diekye baanya dibuo kplɛ le aatɔɔnya nii.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Labuɛ Ɔlaa Nɔɔ Aatɔkɔ Yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Di nle mmle sɛmaa, Yob labɛ kanya nɔɔ aakpaani dii le baalofo nwɔ nii. <verse eid="JOB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Aabuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Ta dii le beelofo mi ni diwɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">ku kakyɛ ka, baabuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Beelofo ni osuɔtɔbi!’<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Dii nwu nkpo- ta dikple ditunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">ta Yaa wɔ katoo atan-yɔ nwu ole niini suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">tanta lɛkpa kuninwii lakpa diakpete ni.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Ta ditunu ku kunyii kplɛ dikple difũ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ta alokonkyɛ asiɛ nini suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ta lɛwɛɛfɛɛ dikpee lɛkpa nini difu.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Kakyɛ nwu nkpo- ta ditunu kplɛ difũ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">tanta ni diakyakaa di alɛɛ ayi kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ee bayɔ bakpee di kɔwɛntɛ kukunwii kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Ta kakyɛ nwu kabla ɔlɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">tanta baanu suoto lɛyɔɔ kudú di kakyɛ nwu.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Ta batii ba ninkpaani ni ayi bakpaani dii nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">mba nielolaa suoto alɛ bɔɔsɛnkɛsa ni Lefiatan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kɔsaanwu kplɛ kule di lekpo kamɛ</char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Ta olesɛ awɛntrɛbi nini akple ditunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">ta ni disoko dii lɛkpa kasakasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">atannya kafɔɔ kolesɛtũ afintoree kasale,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />diekye ditasɛɛ olofofɔtɔ kayoko di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">alɛ aawofasa dibuo nwu di anu nii.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />“Obe oso nintakpi di obe wɔ latoodie ni di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">nin-wɔɔ kafɔɔ di kalofokɔ?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Obe oso di atĩ lawɛ alɛ aatika mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">ku anyɛɛ alɛ aatɛɛ nnyɛɛfu?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Nse kanunua nfɛ nte di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">nse nfɛ nte kɔkyɔsĩi ntɛ ɔnyɛɛ<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />ku kasɔ ka mmle baka ku asibubatatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">ba niatofo ni ayo ya nintɔɔwɔɔ ate ni kanunua baata ni suoto lɛma,<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />ku batunletɛ ba ninkpe ni koto sɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">bɛɛyɔ koto fututu beeyiisa ni ayo lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Ee obe oso batawofasa mi kaasɔ fɛle difutu die obi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">fɛle obifɔɔle wɔ ninadinya ni lɛkpa diidii?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Nfa di bakpiletɛ ndiɛ dibuɛkpee nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">nfa kafɔɔ di mba ditoobuo ni kɔtɛ ɔnyɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Ayo batentɛ kafɔɔ nwɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">mansinnu balanle nyuntɛ lɛfafaa.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Babisɔ ku banɔɔfo nkpe ninfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">ɔlanle kafɔɔ ntoofũ suoto osiɛko di saate nɔɔ ɔkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />“Obe oso bɔɔta mba diebuo ni lɛkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">manta kafɔɔ sɛkla se di kayi nkpe ni osie nkpa,<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />di mba nikomiɛ ni kukpi fiɛ kunɔɔwa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">manwolaa ni kukpi manlenkee ni lɛsaawɛ le beekookaa ni,<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />di lɛpɔ̀ n-yii ma ni kamɛ pɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">mannya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ nse beebuo di ɔkya kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Obe oso manta otii wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">di osuku nɔɔ lewofa ni nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">nnwɔ di Yaa lekpee kɔba eekyisa ni?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Diekye anwununuu ninwa mi, di alesaa kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">atunii nii kodie fɛle ntu.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Lɛsaa le kɔyɛkɛ ni nintɔɔwa di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">lɛsaa le ninkpee mi ni difu nintɔɔbla mi nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Nnaa atoko ɔkyɛ ole, osiɛ kloklo nnaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">nnaa ɔnyɛɛɔtɛ, kafɔɔ dibuo lete.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lɛkakatɛ Kasale</para>
  <para style="sp">Elifas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Ninfɛ di Elifas, Teman otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />“Nse otii owo komiɛ alɛ akakatɛko fɔ, fabanya ɔblɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Kafɔɔ owe nimatĩi osuku ku ɔkakatɛ?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Nyu mmle fatootuo ni batii kpinwu asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">ku mmle fatookpee ni nnɛɛ kpiɛkpiɛ osie.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Sɛlaa lɛfɔ ntɔɔkyakaako mba niatuula nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">fatookpee akunkyi kpɔkɔkpɔkɔ osie.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Kafɔɔ kanunua ɔlaa ntootũ fɔ, ni di nnɛɛ ntoofee fɔ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">kutɔɔwa fɔ di suoto, ni diɛbla fɔ ɔkpɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Diele Yaa lɛfɔ lɛyɛkɛ ninle fɔ disi-tikasaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">di nnɛɛ ofee sisuku lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nle osuku onyu lɛfɔ nɛ?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />“Bu nwu fanyu nunua: Otii wɔ ninan-ye nwu ni ole ntodikpi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Ɔfɛ batodiwɔɔsa batininitɛ?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Lɛtɛ anu lenyu nii, batii ba ninkpɛ ni okpile kofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">ku mba nimpɛ ni kubuɛ okpee ntɛsɛ nya.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Di Yaa owiidi didiki, manwɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">di lɛblɔfiɛ nɔɔ kamɛ, mankpi.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Bakyata makumii, anwi kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">kafɔɔ bakyata siene anyɛɛ lefefee.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Kyata nkpi ta aawɛ bɔkɛɛ amufũ awee ni oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">ni di kyata-sanko abi kafɔɔ nsamii nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />“Baawakoe ɔlaa onwii di lewofa kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">atoko nii lanu nwu kɔfɛɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Di obe wɔ latoobu ni disi di alaafɔ suoto ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">di obe wɔ di batii nte bɔɔkyɔsĩi ni osie kanya,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />lɛyɛkɛ ku ditũtũkũ lamufũ mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">diata akufi nii amuu latũkũ.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Ninwuna ninwii labafe di anu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">ni di sinwini se di suoto nii lataka siayila nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Diayila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">kafɔɔ ntatofo be diale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Lewo layila di anu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ni lanu sɛlɔ buɛɛ nɛ:<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />'Otii-nyu kafuo ote tinini olenkee Yaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Otii kafuo ɔte klekle olenkee Blatɛ nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Nse Yaa diefũ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">nse Yaa nnya okpile di batɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ suoto,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />ni lɛ nfɛ di mba ninsi ni di kɔtɛ ayo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">di asɔse ninya nle ni kudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">mambibiɛ ma manlenkee ni akukudi!<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Di olesɛ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ obo kamɛ manfefee kukuikukui;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">manwɔɔ, dinaa ni kaloo, manantofo nii.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Diele akpaayo lɛma sikũ beebudi bɛɛtɛ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">di mmle baakpi ni di lɛsaa ɔtantofo kamɛ?’<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="s1">Elifas Lakple Aatɔɔkakatɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />“Yob lɛɛ, nse foomiɛ, kafɔɔ owe nimakpee fɔ kanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Ɔmɛ klekletɛ fabamunikĩisa anu fankyɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Ɔblɔ nlo buutɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ kafɔɔ nlo nnwɔ ninan-ye ni lɛsaa.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Ami omu ntɔɔnya buutɛ kose odu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">kafɔɔ kakui nwu baakpaani leyo nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Kanyu lekyo di babi nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">mambibiɛ ma di kakankɔ di dikitɛ nnaa nii.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Kɔka kleetɛ nle alesaa ya eekyeko ni kofe nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">bia man-yɔ nya di siwuu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">otukɔnsɔ kleetɛ kafɔɔ n-ta lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Diekye dikpile ninkɔntɔ diakye kɔtɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">ee dibuo ditaa kaasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Kafɔɔ beelofo otii bɛɛta dibuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">nwaako fɛ mmle di lɛtɔmbula nflɛlɛtɛ ninfe ni osi.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />“Nse fɛ ami dile, ntabawolaa Yaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">nin-yɔ ɔlaa nii ntɛ nwɔ di anu.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Ambla asaa ya manaanu ni kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ manaafuo ni ɔka.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Nnwɔɔ ninta kanto nnɔɔ ankpete kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">anta afe nwɛ ntu.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />An-yɔ mba niɛwakosa ni suoto kasɔ antika di osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">antakatɛsa mba kafɔɔ ninkowi ni katoo.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Anlalaasa asaa balalaasatɛ asibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">di mmle di nnɛɛ lɛma dilaakpanko ni nle bɛɛtɛ ni ɔbla.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Nnwɔɔ nimufũ banumbentɛ di asibu kpile lɛma suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">antĩi kafɔɔ mba nialɛ beebe ni anu asaa kpile ɔbla osuku wla.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Ditunu nwa ma di suoto ku kakũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">kakũ kafɔɔ mampɛpɛɛ nnɛɛ fɛ mmle ninte ni ku kakyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Nnwɔɔ nindiki mba diefĩ ni ankyeko kapamii di nnya lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">andiki ma ankyeko mba sikpe ni osie nnɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Nkpo oso bapiitɛ nkpe osuku onyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">amumu ole kafɔɔ kamadiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />“Suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ di Yaa nlolaa ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">nioso tansĩ Nnwɔ Ninleke ni letoko nanfi.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Diekye nnwɔɔ nintika batii nkɔ, kafɔɔ ankple annii mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ampila batii, kafɔɔ kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ ninkple kunyɔɔsa ɔfiɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Abadiki fɔ ankyeko ɛlaa akuɔ be nietũ fɔ ni kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">di okuɛnsinle okpile kuonwii dilɔbatũ fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Di kɔka obe kamɛ abadiki fɔ di kukpi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">di kakpɛ kamɛ kafɔɔ, ɔlɔbata kapamii katofo fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Abadiki fɔ di ɔkplalomii wɔ ninkpɔnɔfɔsa ni batii nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">tanyɛkɛ kafɔɔ nse asaa ɔlalaa lɛwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Fɔɔwa kawɔɔ ku kɔka ɔbama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">nioso flɔbayɛkɛ babɔkɛɛ yakaya kaasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Diekye kofe lɛfɔ afuɔ dilɔbakpee fɔ kubuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">babɔkɛɛ yakayaka kafɔɔ kamasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole ku afɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Fabatofo falɛ ɔlaa kuonwii nnaa di lɛkpaayo lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">nse fɛɛka lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ, kuninwii dilɔbayu.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Fabanya falɛ babi lɛfɔ kamapɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">banantii lɛfɔ kafɔɔ fɛle kasɔ sɛfa.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Fababe fankpasɔ fiɛ fababuo di ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">fɛle mmle mannii ni kamɔɔ di ofiɛlɛbee kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />“Butɔɔsɔ nle mmle buonyu, buɔnya bulɛ nwaako dile.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">Nioso nu nwu, faayɔ nwu fablako suoto lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="sp">Yob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Nse fɛ bakadi ninyinyi nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">ku dibuo nii nimuu kafɔɔ batika di akadisaa suoto!<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Ditabalenkee lekpo ɔtɛnsia onutũ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">nkpo oso kɔkakatɛ fɛ otii wɔ ninan-ye ni Yaa nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni akplɔ n-yɛ di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ninwuna nii konyi kɔfa kpile lɛma nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">Yaa lɛyɔ lɛyɛkɛ ɛɛkpɛ mi.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Nse bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo lɛwɛ sɛfa ankple anwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">ee nankyue nwi nse alesaa n-yɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Alesaa ya ninanwɛ ni ɔmɛnɛfɛ kalɛ ole nse mba diesi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">sɛɛ lɛkɔɔkɔfuɔ kafututukɔ nwɛ ɔmɛnɛfɛ?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Nsĩ nya ɔkpanko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">diekye alesaa nwu okle ntɛɛ mbuo ɔfiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />“Oo, alɛ kawɛ lɛsaale kɔkaalɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">alɛ Yaa katɛɛ nle konyu ni osuku nta nii,<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />alɛ Yaa katuna ambibiɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">andiɛ mi nnɛɛ ambudi nkpa nii kakuu!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Nse ntabakple nwɛ kɔnɛɛ okpee kaafutu ka mmle nlɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">suoto kayɔɔ mi di dibuo yakayaka kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">alɛ ninsĩ Klekletɛ nwu sɛlaa.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />“Ɔmɛnsie ninkpe mi, alɛ kakple nnyu osuku?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Ɔmɛ disi otika, alɛ katɛ otu kaasɔ?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Nkpe difuɔ osie nwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Suoto sina nii, lɛbɔɔsaa sile?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Nnaa osie kuonwii kakyakaako ni suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">kuonwii kafɔɔ nnaa aadiki mi nii.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />“Dikpe ni otii wɔ ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ lɛwɛ lɛkyakaako eekyeko basiɛwo nɔɔ nfũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">kuntɛ eesĩ Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni ɔyɛkɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Kafɔɔ babiloo nle mba manantika ni disi fɛ seklenyii se nimbiɛ sinfe ni lɛkpɔɔlɛkpɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">fɛ okle seklenyii se nin-yii nii<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />nse ntu be nienii ni lɛnyinakĩi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">di atubakani niɛyɛlɛfɛ eetĩi nya nii,<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />kafɔɔ nse koleele ledie sindiɛ ni obiɛ otoofe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">di difila nta sĩ sinsɔɔ ni di aba lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Kapu bapɔnkɔ dikudi ninkyɛ di sisuku lɛma suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">mankata mansifi ɔfaafuu nwu manaakpi.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Tema kapu bapɔnkɔ dikudi nwu mmiɛ ntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">Seba asaa basunsuntɛ osuku bakyɛntɛ nwu nnyu osuku.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Nnɛɛ lafee ma, diekye baatika anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">kafɔɔ baalaadu ni nfa, sinunsɔ lakpɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Aye kafɔɔ biɛɛtɛɛ lɛkyakaako kuninwii nunua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">biɛnya lɛsaa le ninle ni dibuo, ni biɛyɛkɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Ntodibuɛ nlɛ, ‘Bita lɛsaa lewo di disi nii kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">ee bidiki koto di lɛsaawɛ lee kamɛ bita,<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />ee bidiki mi di lo nii nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">ee bifũ mi di amumu bablatɛ nnɛɛ’?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />“Bituo mi asaa, kamalo kanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">bituo mi nfũ ninanlolaa mbla ni!<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Nyu mmle di onukwale sɛlaa mbuo ni suoto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">Kafɔɔ be di ɔlaa wɔ biɔnanfi ni kotuo?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Biomiɛ bilɛ bilolaa nnwɔ lebuɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">min-yɔ otii wɔ di ole kuonwii nsinnaa ni ɔlaa fɛ kɔfɛɛfɔ kule?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Bia bibawii atrebi di bakuɛbi suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">minkpee kɔya kafɔɔ di basiɛwo lee suoto.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />“Kafɔɔ nunua lekoto binyu mi di anu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">Kamalaa sɛlaa di anu lee?<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Bidiɛ, bitantafaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">bikple bise ninyu, diekye dibu nii nsi di nimiina kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Okpile ole owo nka di anyasibi nii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Kanya nii dilaatofo dibiene di dikpile ɔbla suoto?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />“Diele ɔkpɛ siene kamɛ di otii nsi di kasɔ ka mmle suoto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Diele ayi nɔɔ ote ate fɛle kpɛntɛ wɔ bɛɛta ni ɔkpɛ ale?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Fɛle ɔlanle wɔ nikonyu ni osuku anta ni kɔtɔɔfɔ kunyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">ee fɛle kpɛntɛ wɔ ninsoko ni kɔkpɛnto nɔɔ yi,<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />nkpo bɛɛtɛɛ awɛntɛ ya ninaa ni lɛsalɛsaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">kakyɛ biala kafɔɔ bɛɛtɛɛ dibuo.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Nse lɛklɛlete mbu disi nlɛ, ‘Ɔmɛmbe kamataka?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Kakyɛ nwu nkaana, mpɛ mmumunikĩi ninaase di kolesɛtũ.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Suoto nii letĩi ku akukudi ku apa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">suoto sina nii lɛbɛbɛɛ, siosoo ntu.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />“Ayi nii kɔpɛ sɛwa anlenkee abula losotɛ oklo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">anloo kafɔɔ di osuku onyu kuonwii ninwɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Oo Yaa, nyuma falɛ nkpa nii, owiidi kule;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">anu nii dilɔbasinkple anya suoto lɛyɔɔ diidii.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Anu ya nin-nyɛɛ ni dilɔbasinnyɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">bibawolaa mi, kafɔɔ namasinwɛ.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Fɛ mmle di lelokonkyɛ n-yɛ, ninsifi ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">nkpo di otii wɔ ninsoo ansifi ni ɔkya kamɛ ninsinkple aawa nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Ɔlɔbasinkple awa leyo nɔɔ diidii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ dilɔbasintofo nwɔ.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />“Nkpo oso namalo kanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">kamakakatɛ di dibuo nii ninwuna kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">kamabuɛ ɔlaa di ɔklá nii ninyinyi kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Ami ninle lekpo, ee bɔkɛɛ kplɛ di kakyofokɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">alɛ faayɔ mi fankpee di kanyu kalɔ?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Nse lenyu nlɛ atensaa nii kamakpee mi kɔnɛɛ kaafutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">di asiɛle-yɔɔle nii kafɔɔ kamakɔkɔlɛ ɔlaa nii,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />bia mianwu nfɛ fanyɛkɛsɛɛ ku alaafɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">fankpee mi kafɔɔ difu ku odiki otuo nɛ,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />nioso simu omiina ku kukpi nlɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">dilenke suoto sina nii se mmle.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Lekyidi nkpa nii; namasiɛ nkpa dinaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">Diɛ mi lete nii; diekye ayi nii nnaa lɛsɔdiki.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />“Obe ninle otii, alɛ fambu nwɔ disi nkpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">alɛ faakyɔɔ nwɔ atoko nkpo,<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />alɛ fanyunyu nwɔ olesɛ biala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">fansɔ nwɔ kafɔɔ fanyu obe biala?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Flɔbadiɛ mi nnɛɛ diidii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">ee bia kuntɛ obe kakui?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />O batii nyuntɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">nse lɛbla okpile, obe lɛbla fɔ nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Obe oso fɛɛbla mi anu lɛfɔ ditikasaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ntookple atoo lɛta fɔ?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Obe oso fanaayɔ ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nii fakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">faayɔ kafɔɔ sikpile nii fakyɛ mi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Diekye kanunua nfɛ kamate di kudu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Fabawolaa mi, kafɔɔ namasinwɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad Lɛkakatɛ Kasale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Ninfɛ di Bildad, Suhi otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Ɔmɛmbe fababuɛ sɛlaa se mmle faanaase?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Sɛlaa lɛfɔ nwu nle kɔfɛɛfɔ kplɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Yaa mmunikĩisa ɔlaa wɔ ninkpe ni anfuusa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni mmunikĩisa ɔlaa wɔ ninte ni nkpo anfuusa?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Nse babi lɛfɔ lɛbla okpile di suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">an-nanfi ma kootoko di okpile lɛma nwu kanya.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Kafɔɔ nse afɔ fabawolaa Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">fantikiti Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni lekoto,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />nse feeklekle, fate tinini yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">ni bia kanunua abataka an-nyu fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">ankplesa fɔ anse di kayilakɔ biene lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Kuntɛ kasɔkakyekɔ lɛfɔ kamate buɛɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">nkpo di lɛlɛ lɛfɔ di dii kaama kamate nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />“Kaalɛ ana ya nintɔbafe ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">faawolaa kamɛ di lɛsaa le di bate lɛma latekete ni,<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />diekye kɔsa lete baalofo wo, buoye lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">ayi loo di kasɔ suoto kafɔɔ nte fɛle kunyii.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Blɔbatuo fɔ asaa, baatɔkɔ fɔ kafɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">Blɔbadiki lɛsaatofo lɛma sɛlaa babuɛ?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Lɛkpɛnyi kafuo ɔlɛ nwaa di lɛba le ninambuu ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Lɛnwaakɛ kafuo oyila nse ntu nnaa?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Di obe wɔ eekple ayɛ manadibudi nya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">an-yɔɔ wla anlenkee sɛfa bule.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Nkpo di mba bamuu nieyee ni Yaa nkpa nte nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">nkpo di mba ninan-ye ni Yaa osuku onyu kamayu nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Lɛsaa le eetika ni disi lɛbla kpiɛkpiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">nle oonyu osuku anta ni nle kukuɛmaa.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Ankpɛ di kɔmaa nɔɔ suoto, kafɔɔ kunnyila;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">ansaka ninkũ suoto, kafɔɔ kunnfuo nwɔ omufũ oklee.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Ate fɛle ɔfa wɔ beekpete ni ntu nwaa di kufĩ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">di sɛnya nikũ nfukuti sintĩi ni kɔba;<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />sidu nikũ mmimini di afuɔ dikudi suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">am-miɛ lɛba kafɔɔ di afuɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Kafɔɔ nse diɛkpá di lɛba nini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">lɛba nwu n-sĩ ni, nimbuɛ alɛ, ‘Diidii ntanya fɔ.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Nwaako nkpa nini n-yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">sɛfa bamba nyila di kɔtɛ nwu suoto.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />“Nwaako Yaa ninsĩ otii wɔ ninaa ni ole kuonwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">ee akpee sikpilebablatɛ nnɛɛ osie.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Nfɛ abata kanya lɛfɔ n-yii ku sɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">anyasibi lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Babakpee balo lɛfɔ sinunsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">bakpiletɛ akpaayo kafɔɔ dilɔbasinwɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Ladiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Nwaako, n-ye nlɛ nle mmle nwaako dile.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Kafɔɔ lɛ di otii kafuo ote tinini di Yaa anu?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Nu di otii komiɛ alɛ ananfiko nwɔ ɔlaa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">ɔlɔbafuo ɔlaa onwii kanya odiki ɔtɔɔ di kakpe kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Ninumbe nɔɔ lɛtaka katoo, osie nɔɔ lemuɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">Owe nitodikpɛko Yaa annaafũ nkɔ?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Ankpa abokote manantofo nwu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">amunikĩisa nya anfuusa di ɔblɔ nɔɔ kanya.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Antũkunsa kasɔ di abaninya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">anta akpaka kafɔɔ ntũkũ.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Ankakatɛ anta kufĩ, ni kunampɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">antĩi awɛntrebi lɛkpa.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Lete nɔɔ niananfi osi aatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">ni ankyɛ di lekpo le nikɔpɛ ni suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Nnwɔɔ ninle Okiti ku awɛntrɛbi ya bɔɔlɛɛ ni Orion Blatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">awɛntrɛbi dikudi nwu ku kala kasɔ awɛntrɛbi.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Yaa mbla asaa akplɛ akplɛ manaanu ni kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ manaafuo ni ɔka.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Nse eefe di ɔlɔɔkɔ nii, ninfuo nwɔ ɔnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">nse akyɛ oosifi, ninfuo nwɔ otofo.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Nse ɔɔkpafɛ lɛsaa anfũ, owe namafuo nwɔ osuku otĩi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">Owe namafuo nwɔ ɔkaalɛ alɛ, ‘Obe fɔɔbla?’<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Yaa nindiɛ ɔblɔ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">bia Rahab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kɔsaanwu kplɛ di lɛkpo kamɛ</char></note> bakyakaakotɛ lawakasɔ di nkpaatũ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />“Ni lɛ nfɛ kananfi ɔlaa ku Yaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Lɛ nfɛ kawɛ sɛlaa nnanfi ku nnwɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Nu di ole mi nkpe, namafuo nwɔ kanya odiki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">lekoto lete katikiti munko Kantɛ nii alɛ anya mi nyaami.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Bia kuntɛ lɛlɛɛ nwɔ lɛka, ɛɛwa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">ninfunnu nlɛ abakyɔɔ mi atoko.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Abata afɛɛfɔ nnwɔtɔ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">anta nkɔ nii kafɔɔ mpɔ́ ninkyakaa, ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Ɔlɔbatɛɛ nwuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">kafɔɔ abata dibuo nlenkee mi nnɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Nse osie ɔlaa kule, nnwɔɔ ninlenke!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Nse lɛka ɔlaa kule kafɔɔ yi, owe nimalɛɛ nwɔ lɛka?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Nse bia ole mi nkpe, kanya nii ntabalo mi lɛpɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">nse fɛ ami nnaa ole kuonwii, ditabatuo alɛ ami ninlolaa mbla.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />“Kuntɛ ami nnaa ole kuonwii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">ami ninklesĩ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">nkpa nii mmu ntootuudi mi.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Amuu, ninwii nwu nɛ; nkpo oso kobuɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">‘An-wɔɔsa mba ninnaa ni ole kuonwii ku bakpiletɛ akyuu lɛma anyɔ.’<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Nse ɔlaa kpile lɛwako kukpi di difua kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">Mba ole ninkpe ni, fiɛ diobuo ma nii, Yaa mma ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Nse kasɔ lebuo di bakpiletɛ nnɛɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Yaa ntĩi bakantɛ lɛma anu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Nse diele Yaa niɛbla, ni owe dile?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />“Ayi nii kɔpɛsɛwa anlenkee tosotɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">anwaalɛ anfe anannya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Anfe wla fɛle seklo se bɛɛbla ni ku sekpoku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">fɛle baklikpo niɛwɛ ni ole lɛma boosoo manwa kasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Nse lebuɛ nlɛ, 'Kamayee ɔlaa nii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">ni kamadiɛ sikududu owi, nimumuna sɛma,'<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />lekple kɔyɛkɛ dibuo nii nimuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">diekye n-ye nlɛ flɔbatɛɛ lɛbɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Diekye ntookpi lɛpɔɔ kofokofoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">obe oso nfɛ kasisikiti kasakasa?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Bia kuntɛ lekpe ntu ku kwayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">lefoto nnɛɛ nii ku kolo ko manwa ni kwayɛ yi,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />fabafuki mi fankpee di dibiɔ kplɔkplɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">alɛ bia akpeele ni kamakpɛ mi oyududu.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />“Yaa diele otii fɛle ami okle, alɛ kadiki ni ɔlaa nɔɔ kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">alɛ buayilako ni bawo di kakankɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Nse fɛ otii owo ninkpe atabakpanaa ni akyuu loo anyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">antika akyuu loo anyɔ kɔnɛɛ,<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />alɛ otii owo katekete Yaa letoko nanfi nwu di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">di mmle di lɛyɛkɛ nɔɔ nwu dilasinkpee mi ni difu.<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Ni ntabakakatɛ di lɛyɛkɛ nɔɔ dilɔbasiɛ mi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">kafɔɔ fɛ mmle dite ditɛɛ nii, namafuo.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aakakatɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />“Nkpa nii kɔkpɛ mi oyududu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">nioso kamadiki ɔlaa nii ntɛ kaayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ninkakatɛ kafɔɔ di ɔkla nii ninyinyi kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Kamatɔkɔ Yaa nlɛ: Tanlo mi lɛpɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">kafɔɔ tɔkɔ mi sɛlaa se fɛɛyɔ ni di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Diesiɛko fɔ alɛ faamiina mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">fansĩ nnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">di obe wɔ foomumuna ni sɛma di bakpiletɛ sɛsaabla suoto?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Batii anu ninkpe fɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Fɔɔnya fɛ mmle di batii nnya ni?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Ayi lɛfɔ nte fɛle batii ale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">ee alɛɛ lɛfɔ nte fɛle otii ale,<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />alɛ faawolaa ni ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">fankpɛnkpɛ ni kafɔɔ sikpile nii-<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />kuntɛ faye falɛ ninkpi lɛpɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">alɛ kuonwii kafɔɔ dilaafuo mi ni ofũ di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />“Nnɛɛ lɛfɔ niewola mi, ni diebla mi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">Ni foomunikĩi kanunua fanwɔɔsɛɛ?<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Nyuma falɛ faabla mi fɛle kɔtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">Fabakplesa mi fambla kudù nunua?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Fatanyɛɛnɛ mi fawii fɛle nnyɛɛtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">faabla mi kafɔɔ fɛle nnyɛɛtu be nienii ni,<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />faayɔ suoto sina ku kukũ faatĩi mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">faaloso mi akufi ku nkyasakɔ faakyasa?<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Faatɛɛ nkpa, faatuo mi kafɔɔ lɛbɔmbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">osie lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nnyu ninwuna nii disi.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />“Kafɔɔ nnya nle mmle fɛɛyɔ feekookaa ni di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">n-ye nlɛ nle mmle niale fɔ disibu nɛ:<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Nse lɛbla okpile, fantoonyu mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">alɛ faananfi mi kootoko.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Nse lekpi lɛpɔɔ- n-yɔɔsa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Bia nse ole mi nkpe, ninfuo disi nii otakatɛsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">diekye sinunsu nkpɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">ntofo kafɔɔ dibuo nii.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Nse lɛtakatɛsa disi nii katoo yi, fannaayu mi fɛle kyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">fankple fambla asiensaa lɛfɔ kafɔɔ di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Fanwako kamaabayilatɛ fɔle di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">fanta kafɔɔ ɔblɔ lɛfɔ ntaka katoo di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">bakpɛtɛ fɔle lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ntaka di suoto nii obe lele.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />“Ni obe oso feediki mi di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">dilɛ ditɛɛ alɛ kakpi fiɛ di ninu lewo nnyɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Nse fɛ ntanwa kayi diidii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">ee bayɔ mi di kalofokɔ basifiko ɔkya kamɛ!<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Ayi nii kɛɛkɛɛ nwu diiloo oloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Kyɛ fadiɛ mi, alɛ kawɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ kɛɛkɛɛ,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />fiɛ ninsifi lɛba le manamasinkple bawa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">di ditunu ku kukpi kunyii tunutunu kasɔ,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />di kakyɛ tunutunu kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">di kukpi kunyii tunutunu di asaa lɛkpɔkpɔtɔ ni kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">bia di nfũ di lɛkpa nɔɔ nte ni fɛle ditunu.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Sofa Lɛkakatɛ Kasale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Ninfɛ di Sofa, Naama otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />“Ni sɛlaa se mmle simuu sidie alɛ balaadiki kanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Ni babata kakatɛtɛ wɔ mmle lɛbɛ?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Lɛkakatɛ fukuti lɛfɔ le mmle kamata batii nlo kanana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Otii kuonwii dilɔbasĩ ɔlaa ata fɔ nse fɔɔma otii?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Fantɔkɔ Yaa falɛ, ‘Ofũ onu nii nnaa ole kuonwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">lɛkpa kafɔɔ di anu lɛfɔ.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Oo, nse fɛle Yaa akakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">alɛ aabɛ anyasibi nɔɔ di suoto lɛfɔ,<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />andiki awofasaa kamɛ ninumbe anta fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">diekye onukwale ninumbe nkpe nkyɛ nnyɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Tofo nle mmle falɛ: Bia Yaa ntooyee sikpile lɛfɔ sewo.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />“Fabafuo Yaa sɛlaa kyofole kamɛ owolaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Fabafuo Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kasekɔ owolaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Bɛɛtaka katoo balenke osi- obe fabafuo ɔbla?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Beekyofo balenke ɔkya lekyofo- obe faafuo otofo?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Ɔklapoosa ninya lɛkaana alenke kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">ɛɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ alenke lekpo.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />“Nse Yaa lɛwa ɛɛbatɛ fɔ di leyo katenkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">ɛɛkpaa fɔ kakankɔ, owe nimayila nwɔ di suoto?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Nwaako aye bakyɔnkyɔtɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">ni nse ɛɛnya okpile, alɔbatofo nwu ole?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Kafɔɔ buutɛ dilɔbasimbe anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">alenkee, nse beelofo kuɔ dibi fɛ otii.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />“Kafɔɔ nse fɛɛyɔ otu lɛfɔ fɛɛtɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">fɛɛblɛfɛsa nnɛɛ lɛfɔ fɛɛtɔɔ,<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />nse feediɛ sikpile se ninsi fɔ ni ninnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">fananta dikpilesaa kuninwii disiɛ di lɛkpaayo lɛfɔ kamɛ yi,<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />ni fabatakatɛsa anu lɛfɔ katoo di sinunsɔ dilɔbakpɛ fɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">fabayila kpinkpĩ fanamayɛkɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Nwaako fabayee dibuo lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">fabanyuma ni fɛ ntu niɛbafe.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Nkpa lɛfɔ kamakpa ninlenkee kakũ kplamatãa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">ditunu kafɔɔ kamate fɛle olesɛ.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Otu kamate fɔ, diekye osuku onyu nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">fabanyunyu fanfenko, fantɛ ɔnyɛɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Fabaklɛfante, di kuonwii nnaa abayɛkɛsa fɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">batii kpinwu kamamiɛ sibualɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Kafɔɔ bakpiletɛ anu kamawakasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">blɔbawɛ nfũ babatoso manfe nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">osuku onyu lɛma kamale kukpi onwuna.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lɛnyadiki Di Basiɛwo Nɔɔ Batiɛ Ɔlaa Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />“Nwaako aye ninle batii nwu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">ninumbe kafɔɔ kamakpi ku aye!<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Kafɔɔ nkpe disibu fɛ aye okle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Ninwakasɔ nlenke ye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Owe ninan-ye asaa ya mmle amuu?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />“Ntookple lɛmansaa lɛta basiɛwo nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">nu ninlɛɛ Yaa, antuna antɛɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">lɛmansaa ko nle, nu nte tinini, di ole kuonwii kafɔɔ nnaa ni di suoto nii!<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Batii ba dilɛ ni mma mba di asi diɛlɛ ata nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">fɛ mmle dite dita ni mba nkpaa nikɔfɛntɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Bayu akpaayo nnaa ole kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">mba ninklee ni yaa lɛma ninnɛɛ lɛma-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">ku batii ba ninkpee ni Yaa ɔblɔ nsi kloklo.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />“Kafɔɔ kaalɛ babɔkɛɛ nwu, babatuo fɔ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">ee bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ, babatɔkɔ fɔ kafɔɔ;<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />ee kakatɛko kasɔ, kabatuo fɔ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">ee ta kɔkpaku di lekpo kamɛ kuta fɔ letofo.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Asaa ya mmle amuu, lɛmɛnle ninan-ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">alɛ SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ niɛbla nle mmle?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ di kabɔkɔbi biala nkpa nsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">ku batii bamuu ninwuna.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Diele kotoko ninnu sɛlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">fɛ mmle di ɔkplalomii n-tu ni alesaa?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Ninumbe diele banɔɔfo kamɛ dikpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">Diele nkpa kaanale ninwako lɛsɔnu?<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />“Yaa nimba ninumbe ku osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">kɔkà ku lɛsɔnu kafɔɔ nle nwɔ ale.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Blɔbafuo nle eebiɛ ɛɛtɛ ni kaasɔ lese letofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">blɔbafuo otii wɔ ɛɛtɛ ni di leyo katenkɔ odiki.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Nse eetĩi kanto osuku, kayi nkoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">nse eediɛ nwɔ nnɛɛ, asaa kamalalaa di kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Osie ku lelenkee ale nwɔ ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">otii wɔ bɛɛkyɔnkyɔ ni ku nnwɔ niɛkyɔnkyɔ nii, banyɔ nwu bale nwɔ bale.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Andiki mba ninta ni kɔkà kalɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">anta kafɔɔ bakantɛ mbla babuutɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Yaa ninfũ osie di baka nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">anta ma mampɛ atapo di sɛtɔ lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Andiki olebatatɛ di nsiɛkɔ lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">antakatɛ batii ba nintosiɛ ni di akpomii bɛɛklɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Yaa mmaasa anyasibi ya beetika ni disi anta ni batii kɔkà</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">anklee banɔɔfo dibu kafɔɔ anfũ.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Ankpee banɔɔfotii sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">anfũ osie kafɔɔ di basientɛ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Andiki ditunu kamɛ asaa kplɛ kayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">an-yɔ kafɔɔ ditunu kplɛ anwako lɛkpa kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Anta nnle mbla nkplɛ, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ ninwɔɔsa mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">ankpɛnsa nnle, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ ninsamiisa mi nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Anklee baka di kasɔ suoto lɛsɔnu anfũ di nnɛɛ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">anta ma mankyɛ mantookyikyi di ɔfaafuu di nfũ di osuku diete nii.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Mampɛpɛɛ nnɛɛ di ditunu kamɛ di lɛkpa nnaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">ninta ma mantuntula fɛle batasiɛntɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aatoodiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />“Anu nii ntɔɔnya n-ya mmle amuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">atoko nii ntoonu, eenu nya kasɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Nle biye ni, ami kafɔɔ n-ye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">diele obisɔ nle nta ye.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Kafɔɔ komiɛ nlɛ nkakatɛko Nnwɔ Ninlenke nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">ninnanfiko Yaa ɔlaa nii.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Kafɔɔ aye, biɛyɔ sɛlaa ku afunu bietika mi di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">bamuu lee balaatɛ afa bablatɛ bile!<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Nse fɛle bitabasi minlo kanana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">Aye bitababe anu.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Binu ɔlaa nii nfɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">binu anyasibi nii ɔlaa.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Bibakakatɛ di Yaa disi amumu kanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Lɛkyɔnkyɔ kanya bibakakatɛ di disi nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Biomiɛ bilɛ bitunako nwɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Biɔnanfi ɔlaa minta Yaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Dibalɛ, nse ɛɛsɔ ye eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Bibafuo nwɔ ɔkyɔnkyɔ fɛ mmle biakyɔnkyɔ ni batii?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Nwaako abasĩ ɔlaa anta ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">nse bietuna di lewofa kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Lɛklɛɛ nɔɔ dilɔbayɛkɛsa ye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Ɔyɛkɛ di suoto nɔɔ dilɔbakpee ye difu?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Sɛnɔɔfolaa lee nwu nle ntɔ̀ akpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">suoto lee ɔkpɛ-ofũ nle kɔtɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />“Bilo kanana biɛtɛɛ nkakatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">biɛta nle nimawa ni di suoto nii diwa.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Obe oso kayɔ suoto nii nkpee di ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">alɛ kayɔ nkpa nii nklee ninnɛɛ nii?<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Kuntɛ eelo mi, kamatika nwɔ disi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">nwaako, kamakpɛ nnaadu anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Nwaa, nle mmle kamale didiki nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">diekye otii wɔ ninan-ye ni Yaa dilɔbawa anu nɔɔ!<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Bilolaa sɛlaa nii binu nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">bita atoko lee anu nnwɔ kobuɛ ni.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Nunua ntoololaa ɔlaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">n-ye nlɛ kamale lɛbɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Otii owo kafuo ɔlaa ɔyɔ di suoto nii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Nse nkpo kute, ni kamalo kanana ninkpi.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />“Oo Yaa, tɛɛ asaa anyɔ ya mmle osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">ni namawofa fɔ:<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Kplesa kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kuɔkyɛ lookyo di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">faadiɛ mi difu okpee ku lɛyɛkɛ lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Ni lɛɛ mi, kamatuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">ee faatɛɛ nkakatɛ, di afɔ faatuna.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Ɔtanlolaa ɔbla ku sikpile nii, sɛsɛ ntɔɔbla?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Tuo mi dikpilesaa nii ku okpile nii.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Obe oso feewofasa anu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">foonyu mi falɛ lo lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Fabayɛkɛsa lɛfata le di kɔfɛɛfɔ kɔfɛ ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">Fabatikanko sɛsɔ kosole?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Kafɔɔ fɛɛkpana asaa kpile di suoto nii fɛɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ni fɛɛta diobuo mi ku sekosopo nii kamɛ sikpile nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Feekpee sɛkpɛnkyɛ di nkpaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">fɛɛtɛ anu foonyu nkpaa susuku nii simuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">fɔɔtɛ nnafunkpaa nii nsũ.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />“Nioso otii n-sɔɔ fɛle lɛsaa buule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">fɛle dibula le di bakunsũ lɛya nii.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lapɛ Ɔlaa Aata Yaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />“Otii di ɔsanko lelofo nii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">ayi asɛɛ ale nwɔ, eeyiipɔ kafɔɔ ku dibuo.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Antaka katoo fɛle atoto, ni an-yɔɔ, anwaalɛ anfe nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">fɛle kunyii ninwaalɛ kunfe nii, ansinwɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Fabadiki anu lɛfɔ fantika di otii wɔ mmle okle suoto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Fabakpaa nwɔ fanwako anu lɛfɔ famakanko?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Owe nimafuo lɛsaa le niɛkpa ni odiki okyeko nle ninankpa ni kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Kuonwii nnaa!<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Bɛɛtɛ otii kayi osiɛ ayi bɛɛtɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">feebuɛ awɛntɛ nɔɔ lɛpɔ fɛɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">fɛɛtɛ kafɔɔ obe alɛ ɔlɔbafuo nwɔ ɔwaalɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Nioso kyisa anu, faatɔɔ awɛ onwu anwuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">dilaase di obe wɔ abanya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ fɛle kpɛntɛ wɔ nieloo ni ɔkpɛ nɔɔ ɔbla.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />“Akpakpa, osuku onyu nkpe kuta kowoso:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">Nse beebudi kũ bɛɛtɛ kaasɔ, kunkple kuntaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">kundie anu fɔle.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Sidu ninkũ mbe kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">leke kafɔɔ nkpi di kɔtɛ kamɛ,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />kafɔɔ ntu kɛɛkɛɛ kamata ni nintaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">nindie sɛla fɛle kowoso fɔle.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Kafɔɔ otii nkpi manaatɛ nwɔ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">an-nwuna ninwuna lɛyɛntɛle, nse asinnaa.<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Fɛ mmle di ntu mmɛ ni di lekpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">ee okle kasɔ nsɔɔ kankoso ni yi,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />nkpo di otii nklɛ ante anaasintaka nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ninaase di obe wɔ di osi nsinnaa nii, batii dilɔbasɛnkɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ee basɛnkɛsa ma di sɛkyɔsĩ lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />“Nse fɛ faawofasa mi di ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">fantitĩi mi ninaase di obe wɔ di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ lɛyɔɔ nii!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Fantɛ mi kafɔɔ obe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">alɛ faanyuma mi!<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Nse otii lekpi, ankple ansiɛ nkpa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Di ayi nii amuu ɔkpɛ siene ɔbla kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">kamasoko otii wɔ nimawa amakyɛlɛnsa mi nii.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Fabalɛɛ, kamatuna nta fɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">fabawolaa lɛsaa le di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛbla nii.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Nwaako, ni fabaka akpaakyala nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">kafɔɔ flɔbasintɛ sikpile nii nsũ.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Babasɛɛ sɛlaa kpile nii mankpee di kotofo kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">fabatĩi sikpile nii.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />“Kafɔɔ fɛ mmle di kobokote n-yɛɛ, kunwisi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">fɛ mmle kafɔɔ di difuɔnkpaa nkpa ni di kasiɛkɔ nini,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />fɛ mmle di ntu afuɔ n-yɛɛ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">di atukɛ kafɔɔ nta kɔtɛ n-yɛɛ ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">nkpo fɛɛwɔɔsa otii osuku onyu nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Fanlenkee nwɔ obe lele, ankpi ansifi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">fanta anu nɔɔ nkyi letembi, ni fantɔɔ ansifi nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Nse bɛɛta babi nɔɔ dibu yi, ɔlɔbatofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">nse beekpee ma sinunsɔ kafɔɔ, ɔlɔbanya.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ suoto sina lete dibuo annu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">anwi kafɔɔ anta suoto nɔɔ lete.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s1">Elifas Lasĩ Ɔlaa Aata Yob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Ninfɛ di Elifas, Teman otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />“Numbentɛ kadiki kanya ku sibuulaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">ee an-yiisa kafutu nɔɔ ku kufĩ katunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ kpankpa nwu?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Abayɔ sibuulaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">ku lɛkakatɛ le ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa annanfiko ɔlaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Kafɔɔ bia afɔ foodiɛ Yaa ɔyɛkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">fɔɔwakosa kafɔɔ Yaa kasumu kasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Sikpile lɛfɔ kotuo kanya lɛfɔ asaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">fakpe ɔkplalomii wɔ nin-ye ni kakyɔnkyɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Kanya lɛfɔ kamu ninlo fɔ lɛpɔɔ, diele kale mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">anyasibi lɛfɔ amu niɛtaka ayɛ di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />“Afɔ ninle otii kasale baalofo ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Baalofo fɔ fiɛ nfɛ di akpenkpe lawa?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Fantoonu mmle di Yaa kamadiki ni kɔkpaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Feenyu falɛ lete lɛfɔ ninkpe ninumbe?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Obe lɛsaa faye di awo buoye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Obe lɛsaatofo ninkpe fɔ di awo dinaa wo?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Asi pule nwu ku banɔɔfo benne nwu nkpe di kakyɛ loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">batii ba bia nintoobe balenke ni teefɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Yaa sɛlaa se ɛɛkakatɛ ɛɛta fɔ ni buɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">eekpee fɔ ni kɔnɛɛ kaafutu diipɔ fɔ?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Obe oso di otu lɛfɔ kɔkpaa fɔ kunsifiko nkpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">obe oso kafɔɔ di anu lɛfɔ kofenfe nkpo,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />alɛ faasoosa ɔblɔ lɛfɔ di Yaa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">fandiki sɛlaa nwu nkpo di kanya lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />“Obe di otii nle, alɛ abakpa kɔmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">ee nnwɔ di ɔsanko lelofo ni, alɛ aate tinini?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Nse Yaa dietika disi di baklekletɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">nse bia osi diɛkpa kɔmɛ di anu nɔɔ<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />fiɛ nfɛ aatika disi di otii wɔ ninle ni diyududusaa, oole ni sikpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">oonyi ni akpilesaa fɛle ntu!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />“Kyɔɔ mi atoko nindiki kamɛ nta fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">tɛɛ ntɔkɔ fɔ lɛsaa le ntɔɔnya ni,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />lɛsaa le di banumbentɛ labuɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">batawofasa ni lɛsalɛsaa baafũ ni bate lɛma nfũ<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />(di mma lete baata ni kasɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">alɛ ɔfɔɔ kuonwii atankpɔtɔɔ ni di kamɛ lɛma):<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Dibuo kamɛ di kpiletɛ nsiɛ di ayi nɔɔ amuu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">amumublatɛ kafɔɔ di alɛɛ nɔɔ amuu kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Difu sɛlɔ n-yii atoko nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">nse asaa amuu lɛlɛ ɛɛtɔɔ yi, bayu ndieko nwɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Annfũ aanu alɛ abadie di ditunu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">kapamii ninte kasoko nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Ankyikyii- amiɛ alɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">aye ni alɛ ditunu dii nwu ntoosũ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Nimiina ku dibuo nkpee nwɔ difu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">anfua nwɔ fɛle ɔka wɔ niɛtaka ni kakpɛ,<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />diekye eemu lɛklɔklɛ nɔɔ ɛɛkyɔɔ Yaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">antaka an-yila di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni suoto,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />an-yɔ onunsie antaka anyila di Yaa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">ku kubidifunsaa pinle siene.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />“Nu di anu nɔɔ nkpe suoto asi lɛla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">ɔtɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ lekpinkpĩ yi,<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />abasiɛ di sekpoo se nintoobiɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">di ayo ya di otii kuonwii diesi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ayo ya nintoobibiɛ ɛɛbla ni wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Dilɔbasinlɛ nwɔ diidii, lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ dilɔbasinte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">ee asaa nɔɔ akpɛ akyaka kasɔ nwu.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Ɔlɔbatoso ditunu nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ɔtɔ kamafiɛ sɛla nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">Yaa owiidi kafɔɔ kamatuka nwɔ kunsifiko.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Tanta aakyɔnkyɔ suoto nɔɔ alɛ aatika asaa ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">diekye ɔlɔbawɛ lɛsalɛsaa sɛɛmaa.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Fiɛ di obe nɔɔ kamawo nii, babatɔɔ koto kumuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">sɛla nɔɔ kafɔɔ dilɔbatataa.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Abate fɛle lewosobi le ninambe ni fiɛ diɛkpa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">fɛle nnɔnyi kowoso ko atoto nikɔkpakpaa nii.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Diekye mba ninan-ye ni Yaa dikudi kamale ɔlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">ɔtɔ kafɔɔ kamafiɛ mba nimbɔmbɔ ni ditunu kamɛ asaa ofũ.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Manlaka sɛlaa kpile lɛmɛ, manlofo okpile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">olofofɔtɔ lɛma nlofo kakyɔnkyɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />“Ntoonu sɛlaa kpinwu fɛle nse mmle okle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">dibuo kɔnɛɛ okpee kaafutu bakpeetɛ bile bamuu lee!<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Kɔfɛɛfɔ lɛkakatɛ lɛfɔ kyɔnkyɔlɔ nwu dilɔbase diidii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Obe nikokpee fɔ kubuɛ oso fɔɔkakatɛ nkpo?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Ami kafɔɔ kafuo ɔkakatɛ fɛle aye okle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">nse fɛle aye nin-yɛ di kayilakɔ nii yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">ntabafuo sɛlaa biene obuɛ ɔtaka oyila di suoto lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ntũkunsa disi nii nkpee ye.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Kafɔɔ kanya nii kamakpee ye osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">anyasibi nii kamakpee ye kɔnɛɛ kaafutu ninta otu nte ye.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />“Kafɔɔ nse lɛkakatɛ, ninyinyi nii nwu kanya ninwakasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">nse lɛmaasa kanya kafɔɔ, dibuo nwu ninsifi.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Oo Yaa, nwaako fatɔɔta ɔnyɛɛ leloo mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">fatɔɔwɔɔsa leyo nii nimuu.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Fatoonii mi- ni ditookple kamaadiyilasaa nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">lekoso nii kɔtaka katoo, nin-yɔ ɔlaa di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Yaa nnya ɔblɔ ankpeekoe, ambɛbɛɛ mi di ɔblɔ nɔɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">anwee anyɛɛ nɔɔ ankpee mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">anta lo nii nfiɛ anu nɔɔ antika di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Batii mbɛ n-nya lɛma mamma mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">mampɛ mi nnɛɛ di atokosi ku ɔblɔ kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">mansi kanya kafɔɔ di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Yaa ntɔɔyɔ mi eekpee di batii kpile nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">ni eefuki mi eekpee di bakpiletɛ sɛnɛɛfɔɔ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Asaa amuu lalɛ mi ɔtɔɔkyɛ, kafɔɔ aapɛ mi kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">aamufũ mi siimu, ni aabibiɛ mi nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Eediki anu nɔɔ eetika di suoto nii;<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />akplɔ bataatɛ nɔɔ lɛmana mi beekyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">Eedufu akɛɛ nii, anannya ni nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ni eediki kalokalo nii eekpete kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Ankusa anwa suoto nii fɛle kpɛtɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">antitika mi nkɔ di suoto.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />“Ntɔɔkaa leboko letĩi suoto nii kukũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">lɛyɔ osie nii kafɔɔ lekookaa di kudù kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Anu nii lɛsɛɛ ta kaku owi oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">Ditunu tunutunu lɛmana anu nii diekyi;<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />kafɔɔ nnɛɛ nii lekyidi kudu okpee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii kafɔɔ lɛkpa kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />“Oo kasɔ, tantĩi ntɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">tanta ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii latɛ ɔnyɛɛ diidii!<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Bia kanunua kamaayilatɛ nii nfɛ nkpe di osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">nnwɔ ninkpɛ antɛɛ ni nkpe kaatoo.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Nnwɔ ninkpanaa mi ni nle siɛwo nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">anu nii kowi kaku anta Yaa;<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />alɛ aayila di otii disi antikiti Yaa lekoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">fɛ mmle di otii ntikiti ni lekoto anta ni siɛwo nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />“Alɛɛ asɛɛ lete nimafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">fiɛ kamakyɛ osuku wɔ manankple nii.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Ninwuna nii ntooloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ayi nii ntoobudi kakuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ɔkya nfɛ nsoko mi.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Nwaako bamantɛ lɛmana mi beekyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">dikpeni anu nii letika di ablɔfiɛsaa lɛma suoto.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />“Oo Yaa, tɛɛ asaa ya feetika fɛɛtɛ ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">Owe bamba nfɛ nimayila kamaa antɛɛ?<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Feetĩi asibu lɛma osuku di lɛsɔnu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">nioso flɔbata ma lelenkee.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Nse otii lediki basiɛwo nɔɔ ɛɛta eefũ koto yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">babi nɔɔ anu kamabiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />“Yaa ntɔɔyɔ mi ɛɛbla okyonsanu ɛɛta otii biala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">otii wɔ anu di batii kotufa sita mankpete nii.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Anu nii nfɛ nte tutufuu ku sɛnyaami owi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">suoto nii simuu ntɔɔbla fɛle kunyii.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Diɛbla batininitɛ ɔkpɛ di nle mmle suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">mba ole ninkpe ni lɛtaka bayɛ di mba ninan-ye ni Yaa suoto.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Kafɔɔ, tininitɛ kamakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">mba kafɔɔ nnɛɛ nieklekle ni kamawɛ osie mankyakaa.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />“Kafɔɔ biwa, bamuu lee, bikple biwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">Namawɛ numbentɛ di kamɛ lee.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Ayi nii ntoofe, asaa ya lɛtɛ ni ɔbla ntɔɔlalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">nkpo kafɔɔ di otu nii abiesaa nte nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Batii ba mmle lemunikĩisa kakyɛ bɛɛbla kakũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">di ditunu kamɛ mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Lɛkpa ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Nse kafa ka konyu osuku nta ni ninle ɔkya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">ni nse lɛtɛ atensaa nii di ditunu kamɛ,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />nse lɛtɔkɔ dibiɔ nlɛ, ‘Afɔ ninle teemi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">kunnwɔɔ kafɔɔ, ‘Yaami’ ee ‘Obiloo-sankobi,’<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />ni ɔfɛ nfɛ di osuku onyu nii nkpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Owe nikanya osuku onyu owo antɛɛ?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Osuku onyu nii nwu kamasoo kunkyɛ kukpi n-yoko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Bubakyɛ kɔkpaa kunwii munsoo munsifi kudu kamɛ?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad Kanya Didiki Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Ninfɛ di Bildad, Suhi otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Ɔmɛmbe fabaloo lɛkakatɛ le mmle?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Be anu, ni bubafuo ɔkakatɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Obe oso boonyu wo fɛ banankyue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">fɔɔnya wo babuutɛ kafɔɔ di anu lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Afɔ wɔ niabɛbɛɛ ni suoto lɛfɔ kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ di ɔblɔ kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">badiɛ kasɔ kate ta afɔ oso?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Sɛɛ bakpakpaa afuɔnkpaa di aba ninya?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />“Beeniisa kpiletɛ kandiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">ɔtɔ nɔɔ wɔ nikofiɛ ni ndiɛ ɔfiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Lɛkpa le di akpanta nɔɔ kamɛ nkple ditunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">kandiɛ wɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɔɔ nnii.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Akpaakyala nɔɔ nwu siene ntookpiɛkpiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ ablasaa nimpɛ nwɔ kaasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Nkpaa nɔɔ ninkpee nwɔ di asawu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">ni ankpa ambuo di sikũ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Okũ ndiki nwɔ di lɛnankpo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">dikyĩ mmufũ nwɔ wla.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Bɛɛkyɔɔ nwɔ ɔkpaakũ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">okũ kafɔɔ nte di nkpaa osuku nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Lɛyɛkɛ mmufũ nwɔ di ɔfankyi biala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">ninkusa nintikanko nnafukpaa nɔɔ biala.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Kɔka oso ɔnyɛɛ nsinnaa nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">ɔlaa nte kusoko nwɔ nse ɛɛpɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Ɔfiɛ ntoole suoto nɔɔ kukũ aba awo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">kukpi obi kasale ntɔɔlalaasa sɛfankyi nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Beediki nwɔ di akpanta nɔɔ kasiɛkɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">ni bɛɛkpaa nwɔ bɛɛwako ɔka yɛkɛle nwu ɔkyɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Ɔtɔ nfiɛ di akpanta nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">bɛɛsamiisa amã kpankpa beekpete di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Sidu nɔɔ ntookoso di kasɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">sɛla nɔɔ kafɔɔ ntɔɔyɔɔ di osi.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Onyuma nɔɔ kafɔɔ ntɔɔyɛ di kasɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">asinnaa leyooto di kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Beetososɔɔ di lɛkpa kamɛ bɛɛwako ditunu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">beetukusɔɔ beediki di kayi ka mmle kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Anaa babi ee banantii di batii nɔɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">kuonwii diebu asi nkpa di lɛba le atodisiɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Diɛbla kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ batii ɔkpɛ di suoto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">lɛyɛkɛ lemufũ kufĩ katunkɔ batii.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Nwaako nkpo di otii kpile kasiɛ nte nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">nkpo di otii wɔ ninan-ye ni Yaa kasiɛkɔ nte nɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />“Ɔmɛmbe bibabla mi amumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">mimbibiɛ mi kafɔɔ ku sɛlaa minnaase?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Lefosi simu bitootutufa mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">sinunsɔ dilɔkpɛ ye alɛ biedieko mi.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Nse nwaako dile alɛ ninlolaa mbla yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">ni lete nii ole di okpile nwu nle.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Nse nwaako bibatakatɛsa suoto lee katoo minlenkee mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">min-yɔ kafɔɔ suoto nii kasɔ ɔwakosa min-yila mi di suoto yi,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />ni bitofo bilɛ Yaa niɛbla mi okpile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">ni ɛɛyɔ asawu nɔɔ ɛɛmanasa mi eekyisa nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />“Nu lafaa nlɛ, ‘Bɛɛbla mi okpile!’ yi, kuonwii ditatuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">nu lakaalɛ lɛkyakaako, ɔlaa wɔ ninte ni nkpo ditawɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Yaa lɛsɛɛ mi osuku, nioso namafuo ofe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">ɛɛyɔ sisuku nii ɛɛtɛ di ditunu kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Atootekete dibu di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">eetekete kafɔɔ lɛkakoto di disi nii.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Ananfi mi antɛ kaasɔ di ɔfankyi biala ninaadu obe wɔ ntoosifi nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">atooklee osuku onyu nii eesifi fɛle kowoso.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Ɔblɔ kɔfiɛ nwɔ di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">ɔɔka mi ankpee di balo nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ lɛtaka ku osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">beetofo oyoyiɛ beekyisa mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ni bɛɛbla kasiɛkɔ bɛɛmana akpanta nii beekyi nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />“Atɔɔblasa babiloo-suɔtɔbi di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">baklopo nii ntookpukuti di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Asaa nii baletɛ ntoosifi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">basiɛwo nii ntooyee mi.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Bafɔɔ nii ku bakpɛmblatɛ-suɔtɔ nii konyu mi fɛ ɔfɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">boonyu mi fɛ otii wɔ manan-ye nii.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Lɛlɛɛ kpɛmblatɛ nii, kafɔɔ aatuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">nu latikiti nwɔ lekoto ku kanya nii kamu.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Owiidi nii kokpete ɔsɔfɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">ofũfũ nfɛ nle nta babiloo-suɔtɔbi bamu.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Bia basuɔtɔbi bisɔ kɔma mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">nse lɛkyɔɔ, mamma mi.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Kɔkpɛ oyududu nta basiɛwo nii nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">mba nimbɔmbɔ ni ntɔɔtaka di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Ntooklee lɛbla suoto kukũ ku akufi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">kɛɛkɛɛ niebu se lekpi.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />“Binyɛɛ nyaami, basiɛwo nii, binyɛɛ nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">diekye Yaa kɔnɛɛ ntɔɔpɛ mi.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Obe oso bitikankoe fɛ mmle di Yaa mbla ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Suoto sina nii diipɔ ye?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />“Oo, nse alɛ fɛ bamufũ sɛlaa nii se mmle batɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">alɛ baakpana sĩ di kukũ suoto,<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />alɛ baayɔ lɛbɔɔsaa mandiki sĩ mantika di kakankyikyɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">ee bapɛ sĩ batika di difuɔnkpaa dinaa ni kaloo!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />N-ye nlɛ Dikitɛ nii nkpe nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">ni di kayɛntɛkɔ abataka anyila di kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Ni nse batɔɔwɔɔsa suoto nii kukũ beeloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">kafɔɔ di suoto sina nii kamɛ yi, kamanya Yaa;<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />ami omu kamanyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ku anu nii amu- ami omu, diele otii bamba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Mmle dikle ni otu nii ɔkɔnsɔ di kamɛ nii!<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />“Nse biebuɛ bilɛ, ‘Lɛ kanya bubatikanko nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">di ɔlaa omu odu nsi ni di nnɛɛ nɔɔ,’<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />aye bamu biyɛkɛ kapamii nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">diekye ɔblɔ kamawako letoko nanfi ku kapamii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">ninfɛ bibatofo kafɔɔ bilɛ lɛkanko nkpe nɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s1">Sofar Lɛkakatɛ Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Ninfɛ di Sofar, Naama otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“Disibu nii le nikokpee mi ni kubuɛ kɔtɛɛ ndiki kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">diekye ntɔɔkpɔkpɔtɔ osie kanya.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Lenu ɔlaa osĩ ɔta wɔ niɛtɛ mi ni kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">ni di lɛsɔnu nii lɛtɛɛ alɛ ndiki kanya nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />“Nwaako faye mmle diate ni diayɔ ni di saa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">bia di obe wɔ di Yaa labla ni otii aatɛ ni di kasɔ suoto,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />alɛ batii kpile suoto lɛyɔɔ nle kakuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">mba ninan-ye ni Yaa lɛpɔ kafɔɔ ninklɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Kuntɛ suoto katoo ɔtakatɛsa nɔɔ ndu osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">di disi nɔɔ kafɔɔ nkpanko alokonkyɛ yi,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />abakpi dinaa ni kaloo, fɛle nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ mbi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">mba nintɔɔnyɔɔ ni kamakaalɛ alɛ, ‘Nnwɔɔ mɔ?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Abayɛ fɛle kɔlaafɔ, blɔbasinnyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">abayu fɛle kakyɛ odiki otuo.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Anu ya nianyɔɔ ni dilɔbasinnyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">leyo nɔɔ dilɔbasinnyɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Babi nɔɔ kamakplesa lɛsaawɛ manta bapiitɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">nnɛɛ nɔɔ mmu kamakplesa lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ ninta ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Sekosopo osie nwu nieyii ni akufi nɔɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">kamanate ku nnwɔɔ di kudu kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />“Kuntɛ asaa kpile ɔbla lɛmɛnɛmɛnɛ kanya nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">anwofasa nya di ɔkplalomii nɔɔ kalɔ,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />kuntɛ oloofuo nya odiɛ ɔbla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">eekple akle nya kafɔɔ di kanya nɔɔ yi,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />ni alɛsaa nɔɔ kamakplakpla di kafutu nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">abakple asaanwu adii di kamɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Abatùfa lɛsaawɛ le aamɛ ni antɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Yaa kamata kafutu nɔɔ nlaa nya antɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Abafiɔni asaanwu adii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">kɔwɛɛfɛɛko anyɛɛ nima lo nwɔ.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Ɔlɔbale seklenyii nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">ku sekle se nikobiɛ sinfe ni ku bablɔ ku nnyɛɛntu be nienii nii.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Abakplesa asaa ya suoto diebuo nwɔ ni anta, anamale nya nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">ɔlɔbale nle ɛɛwɛ eekyeko ni asaa osunsũ nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Diekye eenyinka bapiitɛ ɛɛtɛ ma dipii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">eefunfũ ayo ya anantofo nii.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />“Nwaako ɔlɔbawɛ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di nle eetika ni anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">ɔlɔbafuo lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ ololaa ɔtɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii ninsimbu aale nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">nioso lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ dilɔbasinte.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Di asaa nɔɔ kpinwu lɛwɛ nwu kamɛ yi, nimiina kamalenkee nwɔ nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">dibuo osie omuu kamawa nwɔ di suoto.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Nse atoole, eeyiisa kafutu nɔɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Yaa kamasoosa ɔblɔ nɔɔ yakayaka di suoto nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">ansoosa aklɔklɔlɛ di suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Kuntɛ eetoso di lɛbɔɔsaa lɛkpɛsaa kanya yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">kupa lɛbɔɔsaa lɛkplɔ pĩɔpĩɔ kanya kamatofo nwɔ,<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Abananfi ni ambɔkɔtɛ di kamaa nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">kapĩɔpĩɔkɔ nwu andiki di akɔ̀ɔ nɔɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Difu kamamufũ nwɔ;<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />ditunu tunutunu nte disoko lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Ɔtɔ wɔ mananfɛ ni nimafiɛ nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">kunlalaasa asaa ya niebu ni di lɛkpaayo nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Osi kamadiki sikpile nɔɔ kayi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">kasɔ kamataka di suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Di Yaa ɔblɔ dii nwu suoto yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">atukɛ ntu kamatuka leyo nɔɔ asaa ninsifiko.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Nkpo ninle nkpa be di Yaa lɛta ni bakpiletɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">atesaa ya di Yaa lɛbla ɛɛta ma nii.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“Bilolaa atoko bikyɔɔ di sɛlaa nii suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">bita nle mmle dile kɔnɛɛ okpee kaafutu ɔlaa wɔ biɔtɛɛ ni.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Bitɛ suoto koe, nse kɔkakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">kafɔɔ di lɛkakatɛ nii sɛmaa, bima mi.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />“Otii suoto lɛyɔ ɔlaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Obe oso katɛ suoto?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Binyu mi, diɛbla ye ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">bietika nnɛɛ di nnya lee.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Nse lebu nle mmle disi, lɛyɛkɛ mpɛ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">ntũtũkũ di suoto nii kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Obe oso di batii kpile nsiɛ nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">mantoobe di osie lɛma kafɔɔ ntɔɔtaka katoo?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Bɔɔnya mmle diɔlɛ ni babi lɛma ba niɛmana ma beekyi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">ku banantii lɛma kafɔɔ di anu lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Atoko ɔkyɛ ole nkpe di ayo lɛma, lɛyɛkɛ kafɔɔ nnaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Yaa kawesee nwu dietika di suoto lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Banankyue-suɔtɔ lɛma nnyie basanko lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">banankyue lɛma nlofo abi, nfutu nindie ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Batii kpile ndiɛ babi lɛma ndie kayi fɛ bafoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">babisɔ lɛma ntũ mankyi.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Mansa sinu di akasa ku sanku kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">man-nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di kakyukyue didie kanya.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Lɛlɛ kamɛ mansiɛ di alɛɛ lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">ni mansoo mansifi ɔkya kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Kafɔɔ mantɔkɔ Yaa alɛ, ‘Kyɛ wo di ɔlɔɔkɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">Diekle wo ɔkɔɔnsɔ alɛ buatofo sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Owe ninle Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni alɛ buasumu nwɔ ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Obe bubawɛ nse buɔpɛ ɔlaa buɔtɔɔ?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Kafɔɔ lɛsaawɛ lɛma diesi di nnɛɛ lɛma mmu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">nioso lɛblasa suoto di batii kpile ɔsaabla suoto.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />“Kafɔɔ sɛ̀sɛ di batii kpile kandiɛ nnii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Sɛ̀sɛ di ɔlaa kpile ntũ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">di ɔsaabla wɔ di Yaa lɛta ni di ɔblɔ nɔɔ kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Sɛ̀sɛ bate fɛle sibuu di kɔfɛɛfɔ anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">fɛle sɛsɔ di afɛɛfɔ kplɛ lefiɛ kuosifiko ni?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Yaa nsiisa otii letoko nanfi antɛ babi nɔɔ.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Bita bata otii nwu omu koto, di mmle abatofo nini!<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Bita anu nɔɔ amu anya kawɔɔkɔ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">bitɔɔ anyi Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni ɔblɔ nwu.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Diekye obe ɛɛyɔ nwu ole di leyo nɔɔ batii suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">nse awɛntɛ nɔɔ ya bɛɛtɔɔ ni lɛwa kayɛntɛkɔ?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />“Otii owo kafuo lɛsaatofo otuo Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">di nnwɔɔ ninkanko ni bia nnwɔ niɛtaka katoo alenke ni?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Otii nkpi di obe wɔ di osie omu nkpe nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">andiki suoto atoko ansiɛ, lɛyɛkɛ kafɔɔ nimpɛ nwɔ,<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />anwɛ suoto nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">akufi nɔɔ kamɛ lɛla nwɛ onutũ.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Otii bamba nkpi di ɔklà nɔɔ dibuo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">diidii atanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di lɛsaa biene kuninwii kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Ɔlɔɔkɔ, ɔlɔɔkɔ mante di kudu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">ni di akukudi ntĩi batii lɛma banyɔ suoto nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />“N-ye lɛsaa le nimuu disi biobu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">ku osuku kpile wɔ suoto bibabla mi ni dikpile.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Minkaalɛ bilɛ, ‘Ɔfɛ nfɛ di otii kplɛ nwu leyo n-yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">akpaayo nwu kamɛ di batii kpile nwu lasiɛ ni?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Diidii fadikaalɛ mba ninkyɛ ni osuku ɔlaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Fadifũ nle baanya ni fakpee-<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />alɛ beediɛ otii kpile nwu di dii kpile nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">alɛ beediki nwɔ di ɔblɔ ɔnya dii nwu suoto?<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Owe ninfuo otii kpile nwu ɔlaa ɔtɔkɔ, anu ku anu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Owe ninanfi nwɔ kootoko ta lɛsaa le ɛɛbla ni oso?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Mantuka nwɔ manaakpee di ɔkya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">manta kafɔɔ batii ntoonyu ɔkya nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Kɔtɛ nwu di ɔtaata nwu nkpe nwɔ ni ɔmɛnɛfɛ oso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">batii bamuu ntikanko nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">batii ɔlambu manaafuo ni ɔka nle nwɔ katũ.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />“Nioso lɛ bibafuo mi kɔnɛɛ okpee kaafutu ku sɛlaakuu lee se mmle?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Lɛsalɛsaa diebu di kanya didiki lee nwu, kafɔɔ sɛlaa ku afunu!”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s1">Elifas Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Ninfɛ di Elifas, Teman otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Otii kadie kɔya anta Yaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Otii wɔ niebe ni anu kadie kɔya antɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Ɔmɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ dibata Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni nse otii tinini faale?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Obe atabawɛ kaamɛ nse fɛ ole kuonwii nnaa di sisuku lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />“Mmle fanyɛkɛ nwɔ ni oso ananfi fɔ kootoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">an-yɔ kafɔɔ ɔlaa di suoto lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Diele akpilesaa lɛfɔ nimpɔ nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Sikpile lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nnaa ni kase oso?<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Feefũ asaa di babilee-suɔtɔbi ɔkyɛ kasakasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">feediki asaa di batii suoto, feediɛ ma basi akyɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Fatata otukɔnsɔ bakleetɛ ntu baanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">faasĩ alesaa ɔyɔ ɔta kɔka bakleetɛ,<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />nu faale otii wɔ niawɛ ni osie, faawɛ ni kasɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">otii wɔ niawɛ ni dibu, faasiɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Faatososa bakpisɔfɔ baasifi- nnɛɛ fukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">faabla kafɔɔ bakuɛbi amumu.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Nkpo oso di akyĩ lɛmana fɔ eekyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">di lɛyɛkɛ kafɔɔ lefua fɔ nɛ,<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />diɛtɛ diɛwɔfɔ nkpo alɛ flɔɔnya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">di ntu be nieyii ni kafɔɔ letĩi fɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />“Diele osi, osi di Yaa nkpe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Ɔɔnya mmle di awɛntrɛbi ya niɛtaka osi alenke nii!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Kafɔɔ fambuɛ falɛ, ‘Obe di Yaa n-ye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Anka lɛka anfenko di ditunu le mmle kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Alokonkyɛ pinle nwu letĩi nwɔ, nioso ɔlɔɔnya wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">di mmle ankyɛ ankyi ni di kolo osi.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Fabakyɛ di osuku kofole nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">di batii kpile nwu lakyɛ ni?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Baatuka ma baasifiko fiɛ di obe lɛma lawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">ntu oyii nwu lafiɛ asɔse lɛma aasifiko.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Mantɔkɔ Yaa alɛ, ‘Kyɛ wo di ɔlɔɔkɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">Obe lɛsaa di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kafuo ɔbla ɔta wo?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Kafɔɔ nnwɔɔ niata ayo lɛma layii ku asaa biene nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">nioso ami lɛblasa suoto di batii kpile kɔka suoto.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />“Batininitɛ nnya kawɔɔ lɛma, suoto n-yɔɔ ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">mba ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ mma ma, mambuɛ alɛ,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />‘Nwaako batɔɔwɔɔsa balo loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">ɔtɔ kafɔɔ ntɔɔfiɛ lɛsaawɛ lɛma nwu.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />“Bla onwii ku Yaa, faasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ ku nnwɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">di osuku wɔ mmle suoto yi, dibalɛ ninta fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Fũ asaa otuo fakyeko ɔkyɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">faayɔ kafɔɔ sɛlaa nɔɔ fakpee di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Nse feekple feesifi Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni nfũ yi, abakplesa asaa lɛfɔ anta fɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">Nse feediki asaa kpile ɔbla fanfa di lɛkpaayo lɛfɔ,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />fɛɛyɔ koto sɛɛle lɛfɔ feekpee di kudu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">Ofir koto sɛɛle lɛfɔ nwu di afuɔnkpaa suoto di awɛ nwu kamɛ yi,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />ni Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kamale koto sɛɛle lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">koto fututu ko niefũ ni kɔya kuɔta fɔ nii.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Ni nwaako fabanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">ni fabatakatɛsa anu lɛfɔ katoo fanta Yaa.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Fabapɛ ɔlaa fantɔɔ, antuna anta fɔ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">fambla kafɔɔ di ɔlaa lɛfɔ wɔ feebuɛ fɛɛtɛ ni kanya.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Lɛsaa le fɛɛtɛ ni ɔbla kamalɛ ninta fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">lɛkpa kafɔɔ kamakpa di sisuku lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Nse bɛɛwakosa batii kasɔ, feebuɛ falɛ, ‘Bitakatɛsa ma katoo!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">ni abadiki mba bɛɛwakosa ni kasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Abadiki bia nnwɔ niekpi ni lɛpɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">babadiki fɔ diefe ni di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ be nieklekle ni oso.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />“Bia mmiɛ kɔkà ɔlaa nii ntika osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">nu kotunni, kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ nkpe onutũ di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Nse fɛle n-ye lɛba le kamanyɔɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">nse fɛle kafuo kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ ɔkyɛ!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Ntabayɔ ɔlaa nii ntɛ di anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">nin-yiisa kanya nii kafɔɔ ku sɛlaa ɔnanfi.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Ninnyu mmle abadiki ni ɔlaa nii kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">nintofo obe ababuɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Abakpɛkoe ku osie kplɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Oowo, ɔlɔbayɔ ɔlaa di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Nfa di otii tinini kayɔ ɔlaa nɔɔ antɛ nwɔ di anu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">ni abadiki mi di kantɛ nii nnɛɛ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />“Kafɔɔ nse lɛkyɛ kufĩ katunkɔ, anaa ninfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">nse lɛkyɛ kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, ninnu nwɔ lɛkpanko.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Nse akpe di ɔkpɛ kamɛ di katoo-kasɔ, nin-nyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">nse eemunikĩi eefe kala-kasɔ, nimmpɛ nwɔ anu.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Kafɔɔ aye osuku wɔ ninfe nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">nse ɛɛsɔ mi eenyu, abanya alɛ lɛbla klekle fɛ koto sɛɛle.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Nkpaa nii latikanko nnafukpaa nɔɔ nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">lakyɛ di osuku nɔɔ alɛ ntamunikĩi lafe ɔlɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Nindiɛ anyasibi nɔɔ afiofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">kanya nɔɔ sɛlaa lɛfũ mi kɔya silenke dii biala nii alesaa.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />“Kafɔɔ an-yila lete nɔɔ, owe nimafuo nwɔ osuku otĩi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Ambla lɛsaa lele niesiɛko nwɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Amblako lɛsaa nɔɔ le ɛɛtɛ ni ɔbla di suoto nii anloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">n-ya mmle kpinwu eekple akpe disibu ɛɛta nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Nkpo oso di difu lɛpɛ mi di anu nɔɔ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">nse lebu n-ya mmle amuu disi yi, nyɛkɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Yaa lɛta otu nii lɛkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni lɛkpee mi difu.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Kafɔɔ nimaasa kanya ta ditunu oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">ditunu tunutunu nwu nietĩi ni anu nii.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />“Obe oso di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni diɛtɛ obe ata lɛkanko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Obe oso di mba nin-ye nwɔ ni konyu ayi nwu osuku kasakasa?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Batii nkpa amɛke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">mankpà babɔkɛɛ ba beeyu nii.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Man-yɔ bakuɛbi babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">manfũ kafɔɔ kpisɔfɔ nankyuie-suɔtɔ ninnɛɛ di asaa ya asiko ni kanya.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Mantukusa mba diefĩ ni mankyisa di osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">mannyinka kafɔɔ bapiitɛ bamuu kaasɔ, ninta ma manaawofa.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Bapiitɛ nkyi manaabla ɔkpɛ lɛma mambie alesaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">fɛle bakùɔ di ɔfaafuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">kasɔ kosole nta babi lɛma alesaa manle.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Manaasɛsɛɛ atita ya beediɛ bɛɛtɛ ni di afe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">manaayɔ kafɔɔ awosobi di batii kpile awosobi afe kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Abula nnaa ni oso, akyɔtɔ mante ku kakyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">lɛsalɛsaa nnaa ma baatĩi ni suoto di lɛwɔɔfɔ obe.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Abokote kanto nlo ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">ta banaa ni kasiɛkɔ oso afuɔnkpaa kalɔ mansiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Manklee kuɛbi obi manfũ di lɛnyɛɛ katũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">manfũ piitɛ obifɔɔle di koto ko asiko ni kanya.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Ta aklesaa nnaa ni oso, akyɔtɔ di bapiitɛ nkyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">mantuka kamɔɔ, kafɔɔ akà nklee ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Manka nnɔfɔ di asaasa kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">man-wa nta di nta kawankɔ, kafɔɔ otukɔnsɔ nklee ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Mba nikokpi ni atunnii kodie ankye okpoo kplɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">mba niefũ ni nkɔ kɔfaa mammiɛ lɛkyaako.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Kafɔɔ Yaa ninanfiko kuonwii ɔlaa.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />“Batii bawo nkpe beekyidi ni lɛkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">manan-ye ni sisuku nini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">ee bakyɛ ni di nfenkɔ nini.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Batii lotɛ nwu ntaka nse kale ntooloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">anlo piitɛ ku nnwɔ diefĩ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">an-yu ku kakyɛ fɛle yu.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Osuɔtɔ sɔnɔkpeetɛ anu nsoko kɔtɔɔfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">annyu alɛ, ‘Ninu kuninwii dilɔbanyɛɛ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ni an-yɔ lɛsaa antĩi anu nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Di ditunu kamɛ yi, batii mbiɛ ayo mambuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">kafɔɔ mansɛɛ suoto lɛma mankpee ku kakũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">bloomiɛ alɛ babla lɛsalɛsaa ku lɛkpa.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Diekye bamuu lɛma, nkyɛntɛɛ ninle olesɛ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">mambla basiɛwo ku ditunu kamɛ ayɛkɛsaa.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />“Kafɔɔ afuuta bale di ntu osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">bɛɛkpaani kasɔ nlekɔ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">di mmle di otii kuonwii dilaakyɛ ni awosobi afe.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Fɛ mmle di difila ku kayi kosole nta atubakani nyinakĩile n-yɛ ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">nkpo di ɔkya kafɔɔ nta mba niɛbla ni sikpile n-yɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Olofofɔtɔ n-yee ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">kunwɔɔ kafɔɔ nkonko di suoto lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">mansinnyuma batii kpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">kafɔɔ mambudi ma fɛle kowoso.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Manle di ɔlɛma ku ɔsanko wɔ ninaa ni obi suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">mammbla sifutulɛ baata kpisɔfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Kafɔɔ Yaa, nnanfi batii kplɛ di osie nɔɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">nu baatɔɔwɛ kayilakɔ yi, banaa osuku onyu di nkpa kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Anta ma mantɛ ɔnyɛɛ di ololaa disiɛbi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">kafɔɔ anu nɔɔ ntika di sisuku lɛma suoto.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Diekye obe kakuu mantakatɛsa ma katoo, nse batoosifi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">manwakosa ma kasɔ, ni mansiisa ma fɛle batii bule nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">mambudi ma fɛle kamɔɔ asi.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />“Nse nle mmle diete nkpo, owe nimatika mi sɛlaa ku afunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">antɛ sɛlaa nii kaasɔ alɛ siediɛ lɛsalɛsaa?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad Kanya Didiki Yɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Ninfɛ di Bildad, Suhi otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />“Sɛka ole ku lɛyɛkɛ nle Yaa lele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">anta atoko ɔkyɛ ole nwɛ di osi, osi.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Otii owo kafuo bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ ɔka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Owe suoto di lɛkpa nɔɔ diɛkpa dikpete?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Ni lɛ nfɛ di otii kafuo ote tinini di Yaa anu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Lɛ nfɛ di otii wɔ di ɔsanko lelofo ni kafuo ote klekle?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Bia kuntɛ kɔwɛntɛ dilɔɔkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">di awɛntrɛbi kafɔɔ dieklekle di anu nɔɔ,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />ni lɛ nfɛ ninle otii wɔ niɛwa ni kasɔ, ale ni dikukudi-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">otii obi nwu, ninle ni kunnwɔɔ ko!”<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />“Nyu mmle fɛɛkyakaako ni mba ninaa ni osie!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Mmle feefũ ni nnɛɛ be niekpiɛkpiɛ ni!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Mmle faakakatɛ faata ni otii wɔ ninaa ni lɛsaatofo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Ku lɛsaatofo kplɛ le feediki feetuo nii!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Owe niakyakaako fɔ fiɛ faabuɛ sɛlaa se mmle?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Owe ninwuna kafɔɔ niakakatɛ di kanya lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />“Bakpi nsi di dibuo kplɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">mba di ntu kalɔ ku mba bamuu ninsi mi ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Kukpi nle lɛkyɔtɔ di Yaa anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">Kawɔɔ kafɔɔ nte manantĩi ni lɛsaa.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Yaa mblɛfɛsa katoo-kasɔ kolo di lɛba fukuti suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">anta kasɔ nsaka di lɛsalɛsaa suoto.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />An-ninii ntu di alɔkonkyɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">kafɔɔ alokonkyɛ nwu nimbiɛ di onutũ lɛma kalɔ.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Yaa ntĩi kɔwɛntɛ kumuu anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">anfukuti alokonkyɛ nɔɔ antĩi kũ.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Ɛɛtɛ nsũ di nfũ ninte ni fɛle kasɔ ku kolo nkyakakɔ di ntu nwu anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">ɛɛta kɔmɛ di lɛkpa ku ditunu ntɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Di nimuɛ nɔɔ kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">osi akpaka nwu ntũkũ.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Di osie nɔɔ kanya ambakaa lekpo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">di lɛsaatofo nɔɔ kanya aabubudi Rahab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kɔsaanwu kplɛ di lɛkpo kamɛ</char></note> wɛkyɛwɛkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Di owiidi nɔɔ didiki yi, kolo nwu lakpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aayɔ aatofo kɔsaanwu kplɛ nwu di lɛkpo kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />N-ya mmle ninle ɔlɔɔkɔ sɛkpɛ se di Yaa labla ni nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">sɛwɛɛwɛɛ nɔɔ biibii lete munnu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Ni owe nfɛ nimafuo osie nɔɔ dikpududuu kasɔ onu?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Yob lakple aakakatɛ alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />“Nwaako di Yaa nkpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niesĩ mi ni lɛbɛ ɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni, niɛta diobuo ni ɔklà nii osie kanya,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />fɛ mmle lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa di kamɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">Yaa owiidi nwu di anwunfie nii kamɛ yi,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />anyasibi nii dilɔbabuɛ akpilesaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">ɔkplalomii nii kafɔɔ dilɔbakakata kakyɔnkyɔ sɛlaa.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Namafũ nkpee diidii nlɛ oleye nkpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">namasĩ nle ninle mi ni kayilakɔ, diɛlaase di obe wɔ lekpi nii.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Kamaklee ɔsaabla tinini nii nwu, namadiɛ nwu kafɔɔ diidii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">otu nii dilɔbalo mi lɛpɔɔ, di obe wɔ lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />“Ta balo nii bate fɛle batii kpile okle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">bakyiditɛ nii kafɔɔ fɛle mba ninambla ni asaa di osuku kanya!<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Diekye ɔmɛnsuku onyu ninkpe mba ninan-ye ni Yaa nse beebudi nwɔ beeyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">nse Yaa lediki ninwuna nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Yaa nnu nwɔ lɛfaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">nse nimiina lawa di suoto nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Abawɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Abalɛɛ Yaa di obe biala kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />“Kamatuo ye Yaa osie nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">namayɔ Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni sisuku nkookaa ye.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Bamuu lee bitɔɔnya nle mmle aye bamu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">Obe oso nfɛ di lɛkakatɛ le mmle ninaa ni kasɔ?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sofa Lakple Aadiki Kanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />“Nnya nle di Yaa lɛta ɛɛta ni batii kpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">atesaa ya di amumublatɛ nfũ ankyeko ni Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni ɔkyɛ:<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Akpakpa di babi nɔɔ mpɔ yi, ole ma ninle kapamii nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">banantii nɔɔ dilɔbawɛ alesaa kpinwu bale diidii.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Ɔfiɛ kpile nimapɛ mba niebu basi nwɔ ni nkpa, mankpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">bakpisɔfɔ lɛma dilɔbawi bata ma.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Nu eesiisa koto fututu fɛle kudù,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">eetitika abula baawo kafɔɔ fɛle kɔtɛ yi,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />asaa ya ɛɛtɛ nii, batininitɛ nimaklee nya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">mba kamɛ kafɔɔ niɛkpa ni kamasɛ koto fututu nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Leyo le eetofo ni nte fɛle lɛkɔkɔtĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">dite ni fɛle lɛkpaayo le di asaa banyuntɛ lɛpɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Lɛlɛ kanya ante, kafɔɔ ɔlɔbasimbla nkpo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">nse eetikiti anu nɔɔ, amuu ntoosifi.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Lɛyɛkɛ nfua nimpɛ nwɔ fɛle ntu be nieyii nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">kakitikɔ kafɔɔ nfɛ nwɔ ku kakyɛ ansifiko.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Kufĩ katunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ ntuka nwɔ, ni ansifi nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">anfiɛ nwɔ andiki di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Kuntaka nwɔ di suoto di nyaami ɔnya nnaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">di mmle ootoso ni di osie nɔɔ kamɛ anfe ni sitũ tinini.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Kɔfɛɛfɔ nwɔ mpɛ anɛɛkya di lɛsaatambu kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">kuntɔɔ nwɔ kundieko di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Katansa Di Ninumbe Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />“Dibiɔ nkpe mankutu ni koto fututu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">lɛba le kafɔɔ mannyinakĩisa ni koto sɛɛle nkpe.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Kasɔ kamɛ mandiki abɔsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">akpetefuɔ kafɔɔ mannyinakĩisa kupa mankyeko.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Otii nta ditunu nsé;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">anwolaa anaadu nkyofokɔ fanfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">anaamiɛ akpetefuɔ di ditunu tunutunu kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Mankutu abiɔ kyofole fanfa di batii nsiɛkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">di aba ya di otii kɔkpaa ntooyee nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ankpukuti di batii suoto fanfa anaatɔɔsaka poe.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Kasɔ ka suoto di alesaa nkye nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">beemunikĩisa ka kaalɔ bɛɛbla fɛ ɔtɔ;<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />mankutu difuɔnkpaa mandiki lɛsaa le manlɛɛ ni safir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">ku kudù nimi be di koto sɛɛle mpu nsi ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Kansiɛ wɔ ninkyɔkyɔfɛ ni sina, kuonwii dieye osuku wofale nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">kɔɔlɛ kukanwii ninu diinya nwu.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni kobe yakayaka kuonwii diise kɔkpaa di kasɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">kyata kuonwii kafɔɔ niinaayu ninfa.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Otii n-yɔ kɔnɛɛ ambibiɛ difuɔ siene nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">andiki kafɔɔ abokote nkpaa antɛ kaayi.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Andiki nfenkɔ di afuɔ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">anu nɔɔ kafɔɔ nnya asaa ninya ya niefũ ni kɔya amuu.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Ankpɛnkpɛ sekle ntaakɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">andiki awofasaa antɛ kaayi.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />“Kafɔɔ ɔfɛ babawɛ ninumbe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Ɔfɛ ninle lɛsɔnu kasiɛkɔ?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Otii dilaafuo ni lɛsɔnu otofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">blɔbawɛ ni di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Nkyofokɔ mbuɛ alɛ, ‘Diesi di kamɛ nii’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">lekpo mbuɛ alɛ, ‘Dinaa di ɔkyɛ nii.’<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Blaafuo ninumbe ɔya ku koto sɛɛle biene, biene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">ee bakadi ni kɔya di koto fututu kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Blɔbafuo ni ɔya ku Ofir koto sɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">ku oniks wɔ niefũ ni kɔya ee safir.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Blaafuo koto sɛɛle ee awɛwɛ ɔyɔ ɔkaatɛsa ku nni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">ee bafuo ni ɔkyɛlɛnsa ku koto sɛɛle anyɛnɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Lɛsaa le bɔɔlɛɛ ni koral ku afuɔ ya bɔɔlɛɛ ni yaspa ayooto diɛkaatɛ ku ninumbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">ninumbe kɔya lɛwaalɛ anii kole.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Etopia afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya bɔɔlɛɛ ni topas dilaafuo ɔkaatɛɛ ku nni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">blaafuo ni ɔya ku koto sɛɛle nwaa.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />“Ɔfɛ nfɛ di ninumbe lekye mɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Ɔfɛ ninle lɛsɔnu kasiɛkɔ?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Bɛɛyɔ ni beewofasa lɛsaa biala ninkpe ni nkpa anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">bɛɛyɔ beekookaa bia bakansiɛ ba di kɔfɛɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Kawɔɔ ku Kukpi alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Kɔfɛɛfɔ nini lete niedu atoko loo.’<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Yaa nnu osuku wɔ mankyɛ ni ninumbe ɔkyɛ kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">lete nɔɔ kafɔɔ nin-ye ni kasiɛkɔ,<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />diekye annyu kasɔ nyɛntɛkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">annya kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala di kolo kalɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Obe wɔ aata ni kɔfɛɛfɔ bakpɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">aaklapoosa ni ntu aatɛ nii,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />obe wɔ aakpee ni kufiofa aata ni kanto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">ku nfenkɔ aata ni kanto amunaa,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />ninfɛ aanyu ninumbe, ni aanya alɛ dilɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">ni aafũ ni aakpee, aasɔ ni aanyu nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Ni aatɔkɔ otii alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‘SAATE nwu ɔyɛkɛ- nni ninle ninumbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">ku okpile okyidi ninle lɛsɔnu nɛ.’”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yob Lɛkakatɛ Yɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Yob lakple aayɔ ɔlaa nɔɔ aatɛ alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“Nse alɛ nwɛ awɛntɛ ya nintɔɔbafe ni okle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">fɛ ayi ya di Yaa lanyu mi nii,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />obe wɔ di kandiɛ nɔɔ lakpa aakpete ni di disi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">di lɛkpa nɔɔ kafɔɔ lakyɛ ni di ditunu kamɛ!<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Oo, di obe wɔ siawɛ mi ni osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">di Yaa sisiɛwo kpinkpĩ lata ni leyo nii lɛtɔtrɔ,<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />di obe wɔ di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni lakple aasiɛkoe nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">di babi nii lamana mi baakyi nii,<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />di obe wɔ di nfenkɔ nii layii ni ku nnyɛɛtu pinle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">ni di difuɔnkpaa nwu lanyɛɛnɛ nnɔnyi fɛ sekle diatɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />“Nse ledie lɛkyɛ okpoo kplɛ lɛkpaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">lɛlaasiɛ di lekpomii nii di bawo kalɛɛkɔ yi,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />bakosopo nwu nnyɛɛ, mankpukuti manyila di ɔlɔɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">banɔɔfo kafɔɔ ntaka man-yila di nkpaa lɛma;<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />ɔka batii ndiɛ ɔkakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">man-yɔ nnɛɛ lɛma mantĩi nnya lɛma;<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />batii finle sɛlɔ nlo kanana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">sɛkplalomii lɛma kafɔɔ n-ka di nnya takatoo lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Olele nienu ɔlaa wɔ lebuɛ ni nkakatɛ nwaa di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">mba kafɔɔ ninnyɛɛ nii ntansɛɛ,<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />diekye ndiki bapiitɛ ba ninkaalɛ ni lɛkyakaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ku kuɛbi wɔ ninaa ni kuonwii abakyakaako nwɔ nii.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Otii wɔ niatookpi ni latɛɛ lɛtɔtrɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">lata kpisɔfɔ otu lasa sinu.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Lekpee ɔsaabla tinini fɛ akpeele nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">lɛka biene niale akpeele wua nii ku disi niniisaa nii.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Lale anu lata anubabiɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">nkpaa kafɔɔ lata mba di nkpaa lakpiɛkpiɛ ni.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Lale kote lata mba diefĩ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">lamufũ ɔfɔɔ ɔlaa labuɛ latɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Lafefee batii kpile nwu annyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">laklee mba baamufũ ni ladiki di annyɛɛ lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />“Lanyu nlɛ, ‘Kamakpi di leyo nii nimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">ayi nii mpɔ fɛ ɔtɛnsia.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Sidu nii kamadu ntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">kakyɛ kamuu oblokyi kafɔɔ nitika di sɛla nii suoto.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Dibu nii kamate lɛfɔle di kamɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">kɔtaa kamale kɔfɔle di kɔnɛɛ nii obe lele.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />“Batii nkyɔɔ mi atoko mantoonyu osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">manlo kanana mansoko kɔkà nii.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Nse lɛkakatɛ leloo, mansinkakatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">sɛlaa nii mbuo di atoko lɛma buɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Man-nyu mi osuku fɛ mmle mansoko ni kanto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">mambɛ nnya manfũ sɛlaa nii fɛ kabiene kanto.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Nse lemumuna sɛma lɛta ma yi, ninwɛ osie fiɛ manfũ mannu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">anu nii lɛkpa nwu lafũ kɔya aata ma.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Ami nimmiɛ osuku nta ma, nsiɛ fɛ tunletɛ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">lasiɛ di bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ kamɛ fɛ ɔka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">late fɛle otii wɔ ninkpee ni kaku bawitɛ kɔnɛɛ kaafutu.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />“Kafɔɔ bamantɛ nii kɔma mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">batii ba nle sɛnɔɔfo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">mba bate ninamatuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">nlɛ bate ni ku baweewee ba ninyu ni bafoso nii.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Lɛmɛnsaa nwaa lawɛ lakyeko nnɛɛ lɛma osie nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">di ɔnyɛɛ lɛma laloo ni?<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Dipii ku kɔka oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">baakyɛ baakyi kasɔ kosole nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">di ɔfaafuu kasɔ ka ninte ni kafukuti ku kakyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Mansiisa afatasi di lepoo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">ni di alɛsaa lɛma niale olomblo sidu nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Baatososa ma di batii-wo lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">ku kudu fɛle bayu baale.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Baanyinka ma baasiɛ di kakleenyii atoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">di afuɔnkpaa kamɛ ku atuɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Manfaa fɛle bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo di lepoo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">mankakaa baawo di siwuu dibuu kalɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Batii ba ninaa ni dibu, banaa ni basaate babi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">beetososa ni di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />“Nunua babi lɛma kɔma mi ku sinu di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">ntookple owoso di kamɛ lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Kɔkpɛ ma oyududu, bɛɛblasa suoto lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">mandiɛ sita otufa okpete di anu nii.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Nunua di Yaa ntoobudi ni kɔtaa nii sikũ, eetika ni nkɔ di suoto nii oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">nfɛ bootuo suoto mankpee mi.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Batokopĩtɛ nwu ndieko mi di oletanɛɛkyɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">mankyɔɔ sikũ alɛ simufũ nkpaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">bɛɛtɛ kala di suoto nii.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Bɛɛsɛɛ mi osuku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">beefuo mi ɔwɔɔsa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">di kuonwii diɛkyakaako ma nii.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Bɛɛwɛ lɛba beebuo beefe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ni beebuo mi di suoto bɛɛnwɔtɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">dibu nii lasifi fɛ kɔfɛɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">atoko ɔkyɛ ole nii kafɔɔ layɛ fɛle lelokonkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />“Kanunua nkpa nii nfɛ kofe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">dibuo ayi ntoomufũ mi.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Kakyɛ nnunuusɛɛ akufi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">dibuo nii kafɔɔ nintɛ ɔnyɛɛ diidii.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Yaa nte fɛle dibula antɛɛ di osie kplɛ nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">amiinasa mi fɛle akpeele nii simu.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Yaa nfuki mi ankpee di apatampata kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">antɛɛ mbla kudù ku ntɔ̀.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />“Oo Yaa, nfaa nlɛɛ fɔ, kafɔɔ fantuna faatɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">ntaka n-yila, kafɔɔ fankpee mi kanya.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Famunikĩi di suoto nii amumu kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ osie fadieko mi.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Fantakatɛsa mi katoo, fananfi mi fanse di kɔfɛɛfɔ anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">fanwanwanyisa mi di afɛɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />N-ye nlɛ fabawakosa mi kasɔ fanta kukpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">di lɛba le fɛɛbla fɛɛta ni nkpa basiɛtɛ bamuu.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />“Nwaako kuonwii nintika kɔnɛɛ di nnwɔ ninkokpi suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">nse oowi ammiɛ lɛkyakaako di nimiina nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Ntawi lata mba nikonu ni dibuo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Ɔkla nii diiwi sɛnyaami ata bapiitɛ?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Kafɔɔ nse konyu dibiene osuku, dikpile nin-wa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">nse komiɛ lɛkpa, ninfɛ di ditunu n-wa nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Kafutu nindiɛ ɔbɔkaa di kamɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">dibuo ayi ntootũ mi.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Nkyɛ kokyi ditunu kamɛ, kafɔɔ diele kufĩ niɛbla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">lɛtaka leyila di batii dikudi kamɛ lewi lɛkaalɛ lɛkyakaako.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Ntookple lepoo kamɛ baweewee obilɛma-suɔtɔbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">asukusuku oklopo.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Suoto nii kukũ ntɔɔwɔfɔ, kuofifiɛ apoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">suoto nii lefila ku kɔbɔ̀.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Sanku nii ntookple kaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">kakyukyoe nii kafɔɔ di owi sɛlɔ kanya.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />“Lɛbla kanya ninii ku anu nii nlɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">namanyu ɔsankobi di, ɔkɔnsɔ oklee kanya.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Diekye obe ninle otii kalekɔ di Yaa nfũ kaatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">obe ninle atesaa di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni nfũ di osi?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Diele kawɔɔ kale kata otii kpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">ɔlaa kpile kule kuta mba ninanlolaa baabla ni?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Yaa dilɔɔnya sisuku nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">aka kafɔɔ nnafukpaa nii biala?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />“Nse lakyɛ di sɛlaa ku afunu kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">ee nkpaa nii lapɛsɛwa di kakyɔnkyɔ kamaa-<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />ni bita Yaa akadi mi di lɛklaposaa nwaa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">ni nnwɔɔ abatofo alɛ ole kuonwii nnaa di suoto nii-<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />nse nnafukpaa nii lamunikĩi di nkpaa osuku nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">nse anu nii laleko otu nii katũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ee nse baata nnɛɛ nii lakpɔnɔfɔ yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />ni batii bamba bale lɛsaa le lapɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">baasisifi kafɔɔ alesaa ya lakpee ni bawii.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />“Nse ɔsanko lakyɔnkyɔ otu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">ee nse lakaa di lewofa kamɛ di owo nii kokloo suoto yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />ni ɔsɔfɔ nii akuɔ osuɔtɔ bamba atitabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">di basuɔtɔ bamba batenko nwɔ.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Nsè nninkpo ntabale sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">okpile wɔ baakanko nii.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Ɔtɔ wɔ ninfiɛ Kunwɔɔsa ni kule;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">kutabasisifi alesaa nii kun-wii.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />“Nse lasĩ kɔkpaa biene odiki ɔta kpɛmblatɛ-suɔtɔ ku kpɛmblatɛ-sanko nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">di obe wɔ baayɔ ni ɔlaa di suoto nii yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />obe nfɛ kamabla nse Yaa ledieko mi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Obe kamabuɛ, nse ɛɛlɛɛ alɛ madiki kanya?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Diele nnwɔ niabla mi ni di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ niabla ma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Diele otii nwu onwii nieloso banyɔ loo di baya loo nfutu kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />“Nse lasĩ bapiitɛ abiesaa lɛma ɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">ee lata nnɛɛ lafee kpisɔfɔ,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />nse layɔ alesaa nii latɛ lata lete nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">ntasɛ nya ku bakuɛbi-<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />kafɔɔ diayɔ ni di sibisɔ nii laklee nwɔ ni fɛ mmle di kote mbla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">diayɔ ni kafɔɔ di kalofokɔ nii lanyu ni kpisɔfɔ-<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />nse lanya otii owo kokpi ta anaa ni akleesaa oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">ee piitɛ wɔ ninaa ni dibula,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />di otu nɔɔ diɛtɛɛ lɛtɔtrɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">ta latɔɔ diafila nwɔ ni ku bafoso nii sinwini dibula oso,<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />nse latakatɛ kɔnɛɛ nii di kuɛbi suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">n-ye nlɛ lakpee kadu di kakankɔ yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />ni ta kɔnɛɛ nii kukpa di nimuusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">faata kũ kufee di nkyakɔ.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Diekye kɔyɛkɛ letoko nanfi le niekye ni Yaa nfũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">ku sɛka nɔɔ ole difu nwu oso yi, naafuo asaa nwu nkpo ɔbla.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />“Nse ntika disi nii di koto sɛɛle suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">ee ntɔkɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa nlɛ, ‘Afɔ ninle mi anu ditikasaa,’<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />nse lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di lɛsaawɛ kplɛ nii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">nnɛɛ nii asaa ya lawɛ nii,<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />nse nnyu kufĩ di lɛkpa ninkũ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">ee di kɔwɛntɛ lɛkyɛmbi di sɛlɛ kanya,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />alɛ diakyɔnkɔ otu nii di lewofa kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">alɛ nnɛɛ nii laminiko nya aata nya dibu yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />ni n-ya mmle kafɔɔ kamale sikpile se baakanko nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">diekye ntabale onukwale nta Yaa di osi.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />“Nse lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ mi di lo nii suoto di disi ditalɛ nwɔ ni suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">ee lapɔ di obe wɔ di ɔlaa latũ nwɔ nii-<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />nta ta kanya nii labla okpile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">alɛ kakpaani nkpa nɔɔ-<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />nse leyo nii batii diibuɛ diidii alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Owe ninadiwee Yob sina nwu amiɛ?’-<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />kafɔɔ ɔfɔɔ kuonwii diite di lɛkpaka ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">diekye lasɛkɛtɛ kayoko nii latɛ osuku-kyɛntɛ obe lele-<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />nse latĩi sikpile nii fɛ mmle di batii mbla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">alɛ lakookaa okpile owo di otu nii kamɛ<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />diekye difu lapɛ mi osie kanya di batii dikudi nwu anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">nioso layɛkɛ kafɔɔ nfaabi nwu atufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">diata alɛ lalokanana ntadie kayi.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />(“Oo, nse alɛ nwɛ otii owo anu ɔlaa nii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Ntɔɔyɔ ɔlaa lɛtɛ- bita Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni adiki ɔlaa nii kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">bita otii wɔ niebudi mi ni kanya akpana ɔlaa nɔɔ awako.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Nwaako kamayɔ nwu nsaka di nimuusi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">kamatũkũ nwu fɛle lɛkakoto.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Ntabadiki kɔkpaa nii didiki biala kamɛ ntɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">ninkyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ fɛle ɔnɔɔfotii.)-<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />“Nse kasɔ nii lewi keeyila di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">di sekplo ninka simuu lebuu ku nnumɛɛ,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />nse lale kasɔ nwu alesaa nitata koto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">ee lata mba nikɔkpɛ ni kasɔ nwu kooto kanya, ɔnnyɛɛ laloo ma yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />ni ta siwuu siyie di kamɔɔ disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">di sɛfa siyie di akpaa disi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Yob sɛlaa ntooloo.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu Lɛkakatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Nioso batii batiɛ ba mmle ladiɛ Yob sɛlaa kanya odiki, diekye aate tinini di anu nɔɔ amu. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Kafɔɔ Barakel obisuɔtɔbi Elihu, Busi otii nwu niakye ni Ram leyo kamɛ lanya ɔblɔ osie kanya di Yob suoto ta aabla ni suoto nɔɔ otii tinini aalenkee ni Yaa oso. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Aanya ɔblɔ kafɔɔ di basiɛwo batiɛ nɔɔ nwu suoto. Diekye batawɛ osuku kuonwii baafe badiki ni ɔlaa kanya bata Yob, kafɔɔ baalo nwɔ lɛpɔɔ. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Elihu lasoko fiɛ aakakatɛ aata Yob, diekye baale nwɔ ɔnɔɔfo. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ di Elihu lanya alɛ basiɛwo batiɛ nwu nsinnaa ɔlaa kuonwii bababuɛ nii yi, ni di ɔblɔ nɔɔ lataka nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Nioso Barakel obisuɔtɔbi Elihu, Busi otii nwu labuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Ami obisɔ nle di alɛɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">kafɔɔ aye bitoobe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">nkpo oso layɛkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">nintatɔkɔ ye lɛsaa le n-ye ni nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Labuɛ latɔkɔ suoto nlɛ, ‘Banɔɔfo bakakatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">mba nintɔɔkpa ni anu batuo ninumbe.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Kafɔɔ ninwuna le ninsi ni di otii kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni owiidi nintɔɔ lɛsɔnu.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Diele banɔɔfo lete niebe anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">diele mba nitɔɔkpa ni anu lete ninnu nle ninlɛ ni kasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />“Nkpo oso kobuɛ nlɛ: Bikyɔɔ mi atoko nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">ami kafɔɔ kamatɔkɔ ye nle n-ye nii.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Lasoko di obe wɔ biakakatɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">lanu asibu lee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">di obe wɔ biatoomiɛ ni sɛlaa,<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />latɛ lakyɔɔ ye atoko nwaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">Kafɔɔ kuonwii lee ditalo Yob lɛpɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">kuonwii lee ditadiki sɛlaa nɔɔ kanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Bitambuɛ bilɛ, ‘Butɔɔwɛ ninumbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">bita Yaa adiki nwɔ kanya, diele otii.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Kafɔɔ Yob diɛyɔ sɛlaa nɔɔ di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">namadiki kanya ntɔɔ kafɔɔ ku lɛkakatɛ lee.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />“Nnɛɛ ntoofee ma, basinnaa ɔlaa kunowii baabuɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">sɛlaa ntooloo ma.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Ni dikaatɛ alɛ lesoko ma, nunua batɔɔmaasa ni kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">nunua bayɛ ni ninfa monoosindiki ni kanya?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Ami kafɔɔ kamawɛ obuɛle nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">ami kafɔɔ kamabuɛ nnwɔ n-ye nii.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Diekye sɛlaa leyii mi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">ninwuna le di kamɛ nii kafɔɔ konyinka mi;<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />di kamɛ nii, nte fɛle nta beekpete di lebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">fɛle nta dikuuku fɔle nfɛ nimabiɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Dikpe ni lɛkakatɛ lɛwɛ onwu lenwuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">dikpeni lɛbɛ anyasibi nii lediki kanya kafɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Namanyu kuonwii di anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">ee n-yɔ ɔnyamɛnɛfɛ nta otii kuonwii;<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />diekye nse fɛ oye n-ye ɔnyamɛnɛfɛ kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">nse Blatɛ nii ntabakpaa mi kanunua ansifiko.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />“Yob, kafɔɔ nunua nu sɛlaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">kyɔɔ atoko faanu lɛsaa biala kobuɛ ni.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Nfɛ kamabɛ kanya nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">sɛlaa nii ntika di ɔkplalomii nii ɔnya.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Sɛlaa nii lekye otu wɔ niɛkpa ni kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">anyasibi nii kobuɛ onukwale wɔ n-ye nii.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Yaa Ninwuna niɛbla mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni owiidi niɛtɛɛ nkpa.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Diki ɔlaa nii kanya nfɛ, nse fabafuo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">lolaa suoto, faakyɔɔ mi anu.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Ote nte fɛle afɔ okle di Yaa anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">ami kafɔɔ kɔtɛ kamɛ beediki mi beekyeko.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Tanta ami ɔyɛkɛ lakpee fɔ difu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">ee kɔnɛɛ nii lawɛ onutũ di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />“Kafɔɔ fatoobuɛ di atoko nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ntoonu sɛlaa nwu nwaa-<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />‘Lɛkpa kɔmɛ di okpile kuonwii nnaa ni di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">lɛbla klekle di lɛkpɔnɔfɔ nnaa mi di suoto.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Kafɔɔ Yaa lɛwɛ ɔlaa di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">ɛɛnyɛɛ fɛ lo nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Eekpee sɛkpɛnkyɛ di nkpaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">ɛɛtɛ anu oonyu nfenkɔ nii mmuu.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />“Kafɔɔ kɔtɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ, di nle mmle, ole fɔ nnaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">diekye Yaa lɛmuɔ alenke otii.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Obe oso fɔɔka ɔlaa fantika nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">falɛ anndiki kanya di otii sɛlaa kusinwii suoto?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Diekye Yaa nkakatɛ- miɛ osuku wɔ, kɔsɛɛ ɔbamba-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">nu di otii nintofo.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Di kakyɛ kɔlaafɔ ku odiki otuo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">di obe wɔ di batii mbuo ni di sɛkyɔsĩ kplɛ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">bate bɔɔkɔnɔnɔ ni di atensaa lɛma suoto,<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Yaa nkakatɛ ankpee di atoko lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">anyɛkɛsa ma ku sɛlaa osĩ ɔta,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />alɛ oomunikĩisa otii di okpile ɔbla kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">amblasa nwɔ di lɛkanta suoto,<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />alɛ oofũ ɔkla nɔɔ di dibiɔ nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">nkpa nɔɔ di kukpi kapamii suoto.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Ee anta otii nka di atensaa suoto ku dibuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">di akufi nɔɔ ntoonunuu nwɔ ni obe lele,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />oso alesaa ninsinklee nwɔ ɔkɔnsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">ɔklà nɔɔ kafɔɔ nkyidisɔɔ alɛsaa finle.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Anklee ankoso wakalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">akufi nɔɔ ya kafɔɔ batatɔɔnya ni nfɛ nte kaayi.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Ɔklà nɔɔ ntɛɛtɛɛ dibiɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">nkpa nɔɔ kafɔɔ anta kukpi batɔkyɛntɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Kafɔɔ nse tɔkyɛntɛ nkpe di kakyɛ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">fɛ kpanaatɛ, onwii di kakpe kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">ɛɛbatɔkɔ otii lɛsaa le ninlɛ diɛtɔɔ nii,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />alɛ oole nwɔ sibualɛ, eebuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Diki nwɔ fakyeko dibiɔ ɔkya kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">ntɔɔwɛ koto kamata ntɔɔ’ yi-<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />ni babase suoto nɔɔ sina lɛbla fɛle obisɔ sele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">manse sĩ lɛbla fɛ sekosopo nɔɔ obe kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Ampɛ ɔlaa anta Yaa, anle nwɔ sibualɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">annya Yaa anu, ayiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Yaa nkplesa nwɔ anse di katininikɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Nse atɔɔwa ɛɛbatɔkɔ batii alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Labla okpile, lasĩ ɔlaa wɔ niale ni onukwale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">kafɔɔ ntawɛ lɛsaa le niasiɛko mi nii.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Yaa lediki ɔklà nii eekyeko osoo ɔkyɛ dibiɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">nioso kamasiɛ nkpa nin-nya lɛkpa nwu.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />“Yaa mbla asaa ya mmle amuu anta otii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">sɛnyɔ, bia sitiɛ-<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />alɛ oodiki ɔklà nɔɔ di dibiɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">alɛ nkpa lɛkpa kakpa ninkpete nwɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />“Yob, kyɔɔ atoko, faanu mi ɔlaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">lokanana, kamakakatɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Nse fakpe ɔlaa fababuɛ, faadiki kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">kakatɛ, diekye komiɛ nlɛ bata fɔ lɛbɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Kafɔɔ nse fanaa ɔlaa, ni kyɔɔ mi atoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">lokananana, ni kamatuo fɔ ninumbe.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Ninfɛ di Elihu labuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“Aye banumbentɛ, binu mi sɛlaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">aye bakũyentɛ, bikyɔɔ mi atoko.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Diekye kotoko nkyɔɔ sɛlaa atoko kunnyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">fɛ mmle di ɔkplalomii n-tu alesaa kunnyu nii.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Bita bulolaa bunyu nle ninkyɛkyɛ diɛta ni awo bamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">bita bamuu loo butofo nle ninlɛ ni.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />“Yob kobuɛ alɛ, ‘Ole mi nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">kafɔɔ Yaa lesĩ lɛbɛ ɔyɔ ɔtɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Kuntɛ ole mi nkpe yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">bɔɔnyɛɛ fɛ laatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">kuntɛ nimbla okpile yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">lɛkplɔ nɔɔ letika mi kakɔ ka ninankpi nii.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Omɛntiikle ninte fɛle Yob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">an-nyi ni sɛma fɛle mmle mannyi ni ntu?<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Manko sikpilebablatɛ ninkyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">nnwɔɔ ku bakpiletɛ nimbla onwii.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Diekye ambuɛ alɛ, ‘Dibiene kuninwii nindie diata otii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">nse oomiɛ alɛ abuo Yaa anu.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />“Nioso aye lɛsɔnubanutɛ, bikyɔɔ mi atoko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Dikyɛ lookyo alɛ Yaa kabla dikpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">alɛ Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kabla okpile.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Yaa nta otii koto di nle ɛɛbla ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">anta nle niesiɛko ni nle ɛɛbla ni n-wa nwɔ di suoto.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Diele lɛsaa biene alɛ Yaa kabla okpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">alɛ Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kamasĩ onukwale ole.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Owe nialɛ ayila kaasɔ kanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Owe niɛyɔ nwɔ eese di kayi kamuu kanya?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Nse ɔtɛ antɛ alɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">ooklee ninwuna ku owiidi nɔɔ andiki,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />nse batii bamuu ntabakpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">di otii nkple ansifi kudù kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />“Nse fakpe lɛsɔnu yi, ni nu nnwɔ mmle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">kyɔɔ kotoko faanu ɔlaa wɔ kobuɛ ni.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Otii wɔ niekyidi ni onukwale kafuo tunletɛ ole?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Fabalo tininitɛ ku Sientɛ nwu lɛpɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Diele nnwɔɔ ninle Nnwɔ nintɔkɔ ni baka alɛ, ‘Biele lɛsalɛsaa,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">banɔɔfotii kafɔɔ alɛ, ‘Batii kpile bile,’<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />anaanyu ni banɔɔfo di anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">anaatunako ni basaawɛntɛ kafɔɔ di bapiitɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">ta bamuu lɛma nnɛɛ nɔɔ ɔkpɛ kule ni oso?<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Manfuoa mankpi, di nkyɛntɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">batii ntũtũkũ, ni kunloo ma nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">mandiki basientɛ di otii, kɔnɛɛ diesi ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />“Anu nɔɔ ntika di batii sisuku suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">an-nya lɛkpakyala biala lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Katunutunukɔ ee ditunu tunutunu nnaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">di lɛba le di sikpilebablatɛ kawofa nii.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Dieefĩ Yaa alɛ oowolaa batii kamɛ ankyɛnko sitũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">alɛ baawa lɛkankɔ di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Ambibiɛ basientɛ ananwolaa ni kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">an-yɔ babamba anse di n-yilakɔ lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Diekye antɛ ablasaa lɛma nsũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">antakatɛsa ma an-yu ku kakyɛ ni man-wɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />An-nanfi ma kooto ta asaa kpile lɛma ɔbla oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">di lɛba le di otii biala kanya ma nii,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />diekye beekyi beediɛ nwɔ otikanko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">banaa ni kafɔɔ dibu bɛɛta ni sisuku nɔɔ kusinwii.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Manta bapiitɛ kaku n-wa anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">alɛ aanu mba diefĩ ni kaku.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Kafɔɔ nse eelokanana, owe nikafuo nwɔ lɛpɔɔ olo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Nse eewofasa anu nɔɔ, owe nimafuo nwɔ ɔnya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Kafɔɔ ayɛ di nnle ku batii kanya kyɛkyɛ,<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />alɛ alaata otii wɔ ninan-ye ni Yaa ale sɛka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">di mmle anaakyɔɔ ni batii akyĩ.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />“Nse fɛle otii lɛtɔkɔ Yaa alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Lekpi lɛpɔɔ, kafɔɔ namasimbla okpile.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Tuo mi lɛsaa le ninamafuo ni ɔnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">nse ninlolaa mbla, namasinkple mbla nkpo.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Ni Yaa kata fɔ letota di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">di obe wɔ feesĩ fanankyi ni di sikpile nwu suoto?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Dikpe ni feenyu nwu ole, diele ami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">nioso tɔkɔ mi lɛsaa le faye ni.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />“Batii ba ninkpe ni lɛsɔnu kobuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">banumbentɛ ba ninu mi ni ntɔkɔ mi alɛ,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Yob nkakatɛ di lɛsaatofo diesi nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">sɛlaa nɔɔ nnaa lɛsɔnu.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Oo, alɛ basɔ Yob balaadunko kayɛntɛkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">ta mmle oodiki ni kanya fɛle otii kpile oso!<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />An-yɔ ɔtaka-oyila ankyakaa di sikpile nɔɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ɔɔpɛ anɛɛkya nɔɔ di sɛma kanya ankpee kaamɛ loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ambuɛ sɛlaa nɔɔ ankyakaa antaka anyila di Yaa suoto.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Ninfɛ di Elihu labuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Feenyu falɛ nle mmle nlɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">Foobuɛ falɛ, ‘Yaa kamatɛɛ mbla tinini.’<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Kafɔɔ fɛɛkaalɛ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Lɛmɛmbiene dile diɛtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">obe kafɔɔ kamawɛ di sikpile ɔtambla kamɛ?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />“Komiɛ nlɛ kodiki kanya nta afɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">ku basiɛwo ba di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Takatɛ anu fanyu osi faanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">nyu alokonkyɛ ya niɛtaka katoo alenke fɔ ni.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Nse fɛɛbla okpile, lɛ di nnwu kukpanko nwɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Nse sikpile lɛfɔ mpɔ, obe di nnwu kubabla kuntɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Nse fate tinini, be fantɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">ee be anfũ ankyeko nnɛɛ lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Otii fɛle suoto lɛfɔ okle lete di sikpile lɛfɔ ole nfuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kafɔɔ batii babi lete suoto.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />“Batii n-wi di atoo ya ninyinka ma ni kalɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">mantikiti lekoto alɛ bafũ ma bakyeko kɔnɛɛ siene nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Kafɔɔ kuonwii ninkaalɛ alɛ, ‘Ɔfɛ di Yaa, Blatɛ nii nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">nnwɔ ninta ni sinu ku kakyɛ,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />antuo wo ni asaa anlenkee ni mmle antuo ni babɔkɛɛ ba kaasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">anta wo mumbe ni anu munlenkee ni bakansiɛ ba di kɔfɛɛfɔ?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Anntuna kanya, nse batii lewi bɛɛlɛɛ Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">ta batii kpile suoto katoo ɔtakatɛsa oso.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Nwaako, Yaa ninnu lekoto fukuti lɛma nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni ninkyɔɔ ni atoko.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Nle niɛpa ni mbi difuɔ dilenke ni ninle alɛ, abanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">nse feebuɛ falɛ faanyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">ni ɔlaa lɛfɔ nte di anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ni dikpeni kafɔɔ feesoko nwɔ,<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />diɛkyakaa nii, alɛ diidii ɔblɔ nɔɔ ninnanfi kootoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">ni kafɔɔ anntofo sikpile se oole nii.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Nioso Yob mbɛ kanya nɔɔ ku lɛkakatɛ fukuti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">aakyakaa sɛlaa kpinwu di lɛsaatofo diesi ni kaamɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu Lakple Aakakatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu lakple aakakatɛ alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />“Tɛsuotokoe kɛɛkɛ, ni kamatuo fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">nlɛ sɛlaa kpinwu nkpe kamabuɛ ni di Yaa disi.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />N-wɛ lɛsaatofo nii nkyeko kakyonkɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">kamayɔ lɛbɛ nta Blatɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Fũ fanu falɛ sɛlaa nii diele sɛlaa-ku-afunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">nnwɔ ninkpe ni lɛsaatofo nwaa nkpe di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />“Yaa lemuɔ alenke, kafɔɔ an-nyu batii nyakatãa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">akpe osie, anyila kpinkpĩ di disitikasaa nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Annta batii kpile basiɛ nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">kafɔɔ anta mba nikonu ni dibuo lɛbɛ lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Annkyisa anu nɔɔ di batininitɛ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ansiɛsa ma di akpomii suoto ku baka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">antakatɛsa ma katoo dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Kafɔɔ nse beekpee batii anyɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">di dibuo lenii ma diɛtɛ yi,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />antɔkɔ ma lɛsaa le bɛɛbla nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">alɛ bɛɛbla okpile di suoto ɔtakatɛsa kanya.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Yaa nta ma mannu kɔkà,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">andiki ma kanya alɛ badiɛ sikpile lɛma ɔbla.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Nse beenu nwɔ ɔlaa, beesumu nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">ni babasiɛ di lɛlɛ kamɛ di ayi lɛma bule kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">alɛɛ lɛma kafɔɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Kafɔɔ nse baanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">ni babawɔɔ di kapamii kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">mankpi kafɔɔ di lɛsaatofo diesi ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />“Mba ninan-yɛkɛ ni Yaa nnya ɔblɔ di situ lɛma kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">bia nse eekpee ma sɛkpɛnkyɛ yi, mannwi baakaalɛ lɛkyakaako.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Mankpi di sekosopo lɛma obe kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">di nfiofa basɔnɔbakpeetɛ basuɔtɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Kafɔɔ mba diobuo nii, andiki ma di dibuo lɛma kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">ankakatɛ anta ma di ninyinyi lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />“Yaa kodiki fɔ ankyeko nimiina kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">anwako lɛba le niɛblɛfɛ ni di ole kuonwii nnaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">anta suoto n-yɔɔ fɔ ku alesaa biene kpinwu di opunu lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Kafɔɔ nunua batɔɔyɔ lɛkanko kplɛ le niesiɛko ni bakpiletɛ nwu beetika fɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">lɛkanko ku lɛpɔɔ okpi ntɔɔwa fɔ di suoto.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Lolaafanyu falɛ otii kuonwii diɛkyɔnkyɔ fɔ ku lɛsaawɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">tanta ditunu kamɛ asaa kplɛ ofũ lamunikĩisa fɔ aafuusa.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">ee bia osie lɛfɔ omuu okyiini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">kafuo fɔ oklee alɛ falaasiɛ di nimiina kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Tannyu kakyɛ osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">alɛ faawududusa batii fandiki di ayo lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Lolaafanyu, tamunikĩi fakyɔɔ okpile anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">nnwɔ feenyu falɛ kulɛ kulenke ni dibuo.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />“Yaa lɛtaka katoo di osie nɔɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">Owe ninle asaatuotɛ fɛle nnwɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Owe nintuo nwɔ sisuku se aafe ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">ee antɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, ‘Fɛɛbla lɛsaa lalaale’?<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Nyuma faatansa ɔkpɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">nnwɔ di batii ntɔɔtansa ni di sinu ɔsa kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Batii bamuu ntɔɔnya nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">batii nnyu nwu di kakyonkɔ.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Nyu mmle di Yaa lemuɔ ni- alenke ni lɛsɔnu loo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">Alɛɛ nɔɔ lɛpɔ nlenke n-ya baawolaa ni kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />“Nnwɔɔ ninkplesa ntu lɛlɛsɛ lɛlɛsɛ ansifiko osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">ninkyi nimbla ni kanto ninkple ni seklenyii;<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />alokonkyɛ nta kanto nnɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">yoo ankpete di batii suoto.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Owe nimanu kasɔ di mmle di Yaa mblɛfɛsa ni alokonkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">ku mmle ankpududuu ankyeko ni akpanta nɔɔ kasɔ onu?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Nyu mmle ansamiisa ni ɔplalaa amunaa nɔɔ ankyisa ni suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">antĩi ni kafɔɔ lekpo nkyofokɔ.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Osuku wɔ mmle suoto akle nnle oonyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">anta batii alesaa kpinwu nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />An-yiisa nnɛɛ nɔɔ pɔ ku ɔplalaa amunaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">ni andiki nwɔ kanya kunkplalaa di nsũ katɛkɔ ninwu nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Okpududuu nɔɔ n-yie lɛkya di afɛɛfɔ ya nikɔwa ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">bia babɔkɛɛ ntofo alɛ ɔɔwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu Lɛkakatɛ Yɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />“Nle mmle nta otu nii mpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">kunkpa di kasiɛkɔ ninwu.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Binu! Binu dikpududuu nɔɔ sɛlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">amumuɛ ya nikodie ankye ni kanya nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Yaa ndiki ɔplalaa amunaa nɔɔ osuku ankpete di kolo kumuu kalɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">an-yɔ nwu ankyesee kasɔ n-yɛntɛlekɔ nwu.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Nni kamaa nimunaa nɔɔ sɛlɔ ndie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ankpududuu ku sɛka nɔɔ sɛlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Nse sɛlɔ nɔɔ kanya ledie yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ansintĩi lɛsalɛsaa osuku.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Yaa sɛlɔ nkpududuu di sisuku se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">ambla asaa kplɛ ya ninlenke ni lɛsɔnu loo.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Ambuɛ antɔkɔ atubakani alɛ, ‘Nɔ́ɔ fakpete kaasɔ suoto,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">antɔkɔ kafɔɔ kanto diwiiwii alɛ, ‘Bla kanto kplɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Di mmle di batii ba bamuu ɛɛbla ni katofo ni ɔkpɛ nɔɔ mantɛ ni nsũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">anta otii biala ndiɛ ɔkpɛ nɔɔ ɔbla.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Babɔkɛɛ nnaawofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">manka di ayo lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Afɛɛfɔ kplɛ ndie di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">lɛwɔɔfɔ nkye kɔfɛɛfɔ ko ninfɛ ni kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Yaa owiidi nta ntu nnii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">sekle kplɛ kafɔɔ nkple afuɔ.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />An-yɔ ntu antitika di alokonkyɛ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">ansamiisa ɔplalaa amunaa nɔɔ anfenko kaamɛ ninya.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Di Yaa osuku otuo kanya ankyɛ ankyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">kasɔ kamuu anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ambla lɛsaa lele ɛɛtɔkɔ nya alɛ abla.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Yaa nwako alokonkyɛ nwu alɛ abananfi batii kootoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">ee abata ntu di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto, antuo kafɔɔ lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />“Yob, nu ɔlaa wɔ mmle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">yila, faabu disi di Yaa sɛkpɛ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ suoto.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Faye mmle di Yaa mumunikĩisa ni alokonkyɛ sisuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">anta ni ɔplalaa nɔɔ mmunaa ni?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Faye mmle di alokonkyɛ mbla ansaka ni di kolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">sɛkpɛ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ di nnwɔ ninkpe ni lɛsaatofo nwaa kɔbla ni?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Afɔ wɔ di akpeele nfila fɔ ni di suoto lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">di kasɔ nte ni kloklo di kala-kasɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ kalɔ,<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />fabafuo ɔkyakaa di suoto nɔɔ mimblɛfɛsa kolo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">ko ninkpe ni osie fɛ awɛwɛ ya bɛɛyɔ lɛbɔɔsaa bɛɛblɛ ni?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />“Tɔkɔ wo ɔlaa wɔ buɔtɔkɔ ni Yaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">bulɔbafuo ɔlaa loo ɔyɔ ɔtɛ di anu nɔɔ, ta ditunu loo oso.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Batɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ komiɛ nlɛ nkakatɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Otii owo kamatɔkɔ alɛ bamɛ nwɔ?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Kanunua otii kuonwii dilɔbafuo kufĩ onyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">di mmle kunkpa ni di kolo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">nse kɔfɛɛfɔ ntoofiɛ alokonkyɛ klekle kuofenko sɛmaa.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Abakye katoo-kasɔ anwa di koto sɛɛle sɛlɛ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Yaa kɔwa di sɛka ole lɛkyɛ kanya.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Bulɔbafuo Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni ɔtɛɛtɛɛ, ɛɛtaka katoo di osie kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">di lɛkanko nwaa ku ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ kamɛ yi, annyinka batii.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Nioso batii n-yɛkɛ nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">diekye akpe dibu ɛɛta mba bamuu niebe ni anu di situ kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Latuna Aata Yob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ladiki kanya aatɔkɔ Yob di kakitikɔ kamɛ nɛ. Aabuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Owe ninle nnwɔ mmle nikosĩ ni kɔkà nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">ku sɛlaa se di lɛsaatofo diesi ni?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Pɛ lɛtapo fɛle osuɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ninkaalɛ fɔ ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">faadiki kanya fatɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />“Ɔfɛ faawɛ di obe wɔ lase ni kasɔ lɛsɔse?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Tɔkɔ mi, nse feenu kasɔ.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Owe niatɛ lɛtembi nika nsũ? Nwaako faye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Owe niablɛfɛsa lɛklapoosaa ole aafenko ka di suoto?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Obe suoto baase ka nkpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">ee owe niase ka leyokɔ difuɔ-<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />di obe wɔ di olesɛ awɛntrɛbi lasi aasa ni sinu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">di Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ layiisa ni suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />“Owe niasɛɛ lekpo aakpee di akloo sɛmaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">di obe wɔ diabɛ diadie ni di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ,<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />di obe wɔ layɔ alokonkyɛ labla ni abula nini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">lamiminisa nini kafɔɔ di ditunu tunutunu kamɛ,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />di obe wɔ latɛ ni kasekɔ lata nini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">latɛ ni kafɔɔ n-yoko ku abɔɔsaa nini di aba ninya,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />di obe wɔ labuɛ ni nlɛ, ‘Nfũ mmle fabapɛ fandu ni, ni flɔbasinkyɛ ni sitũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">ni nfũ di ɔpɛ lɛfɔ lɛkanta nwu kamase ni’?<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />“Fatodi diki kanya fɛɛtɔkɔ olesɛ ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">ee feetuo kolesɛtũ kasiɛkɔ ninwu,<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />alɛ kuafe di kasɔ nwu atokosi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">fansɔsɔkɔ batii kpile fandiki di suoto nika?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Kasɔ n-yɔ letembi nika fɛle kɔtɛ ko ninsi ni di nsũ ɔtɛ kalɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">di kɔkpana nini nte ni fɛle dibula ale okle.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Mansĩ batii kpile lɛkpa lɛma ɔyɔ ɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">manfee kafɔɔ kɔnɛɛ lɛma ko mantakatɛsa ni katoo.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />“Fatodikyɛ fɛɛlaadu lekpo kataakɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">ee fatodikyɛ di kalɔ kakyofokɔ nwu?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Batodituo fɔ kukpi n-yoko nwu fɛɛnya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Fatodinya kukpi kunyii fɛɛnya?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Fatoonu kasɔ lɛblɛfɛ kasɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Tɔkɔ mi, nse faye n-ya mmle amuu.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />“Ɔmɛsuku manfe mankyɛ lɛkpa kasiɛkɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Ɔfɛ kafɔɔ di ditunu nsi?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Fabafuo nya ɔyɔ osifiko nsiɛkɔ lɛma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Faye nfenkɔ be manfe mankyɛ ni nsiɛkɔ lɛma?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Nwaako faye, diekye di obe nwu batoolofo fɔ kofokofoko!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">Fatoosiɛ nkpa alɛɛ kpinwu!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />“Fatoodibuo atubakani asaa katɛkɔ leyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">ee fɛɛnya atubakani asaa katɛkɔ ayo<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />n-ya lebu lese lɛta ni ɔlaa ɔwɛ obe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">diɛta ni kakpɛ ku nkpɛ ayi?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Ɔmɛnsuku manfe mankyɛ lɛba le di ɔplalaa amunaa ndie ninkye ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">ee lɛba le mansamiisa ni kufĩ katunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ mankpee ni kaasɔ suoto?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Owe nimbɛ okplo anta kanto kplɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:25">ku osuku anta kanto okpududuu,<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />anta ntu di lɛba le di otii kuonwii diesi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">ɔfaafuu wɔ di kuonwii diesi ni ninwu,<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />anta ni ntu di kasɔ ka ninte ni kafukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">anta ni kasɔ nwu n-yie ni ku sɛfa?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Kanto nwu nkpe kote?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Owe ninle kote ɛɛta oblokyi alɛsɛ nwu?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Owe olofofɔtɔ di ntu be nienii ni lekye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Owe nielofo ntu nyɛnɛnɛɛ be ninkye ni kolo,<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />di ntu nwu mmawɛ ni osie fɛ difuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">di nkyofokɔ osi mbla ni kekleke?<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />“Faafuo awɛntrɛbi ya nikɔlɛ ni onyu dikudi onii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Faafuo okũ wɔ nimmufũ ni awɛntrɛbi ya bɔɔlɛɛ ni Orion anklee ni ofukuti?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Faafuo awɛntrɛbi kayi odieko di obe ninya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">ee fanleko Kɔɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false" /><char style="fqa" closed="false">kolesɛtũ lɛwɛntrɛbi </char></note> ku abi katũ?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Faye osi afiofa nwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Faafuo Yaa sɛka ole osie ose di kasɔ suoto?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />“Faafuo sɛlɔ lɛfɔ katoo ɔtakatɛsa sinnadu alokonkyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">faantĩi suoto lɛfɔ ku ntu-yiile?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Faafuokanto amunaa osuku odiki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Mantɔkɔ fɔ alɛ, ‘Nyawo ninfũ’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Owe niayɔ ninumbe aakpee di otu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">ee aata lɛsaatofo lawɛ disibu?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Owe ninkpe ninumbe abaka ni alokonkyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">Owe nimafuo osi abukii ntu ɔnyɛɛnɛ owii<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />di kudu kubabla kekleke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">di kasɔ apatapata asi di lɛba ninwii?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />“Fankpa fanta kyata-sanko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">fanta kafɔɔ bakyata n-le mammiɛ,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />nse bafufuu di ayo lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">ee bɛɛklɛ bate di lepoo kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Owe nimmiɛ alesaa anta kwakwalobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">nse abi nɔɔ lewi ɛɛlɛɛ Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">ɛɛkyɛ eekyikyii, ta alesaa nnaa ni oso?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lakple Aadiki Yob Kanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />“Faye obe wɔ di kobokote batie nlofo ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Fan-nyu obe wɔ di kafɛ̀ nlofo ni abi nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Fanka awɛntɛ nwu ninaase di obe wɔ manwɛ ni nkpa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Faye obe wɔ manlofo ni?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Manfuu kaasɔ manlofo abi lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">kolofo lɛma dibuo nnaase.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Abi lɛma mmuɔ, anwɛ osie di apoo kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">abi nwu ndie ansifi, ansinkple aawa.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />“Owe ninta kuɔ suoto osiɛko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Owe ninfukuti okũ nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Latɔɔ ɔfaafuu fɛ leyo nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">kasɔ fududu fɛ kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Am-ma kudu ko ninkpe ni di okpoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">annu kpatɛ afafaa.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Annaamiɛ sɛfa kaweekɔ nɔɔ di akpenkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">anwolaa lɛsaa lele ninle lɛkɔnle.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />“Kɔkɔ̀ kamatuna alɛ ɔɔbasumu fɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Abasiɛ di leyo lɛfɔ ku kakyɛ?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Fabafuo nwɔ onii ɔkaasa ku lɛnwa le nimbɛ ni sekplo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Abafuu sɛtaata se di sɛmaa lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Fabatika nwɔ anu ta osie kplɛ nɔɔ oso?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Fabadiɛ ɔkpɛ lɛfɔ nutũle nwu fantɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Fabafuo nwɔ disi otika alɛ abayɔ kamɔɔ lɛfɔ anwako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">amasiisa ka di kakpaa lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />“Klɛkumi mpɛ afoko ku suoto lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">kafɔɔ blafuo ɔkaatɛɛ ku kɔkyɛnyi afoko ku selonkoo.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Anfa afuɔ nɔɔ antɛ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">anta nya anfila di ɔtɛnsia kamɛ,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />an-yee alɛ kɔkpaa kabibiɛ nya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">ee lepoo bɔkɛɛ owo kanafu nya.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Ankpakpayi abi nɔɔ, fɛ diele ale nwɔ ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">aaklesĩ alɛ diabuo nwɔ kasakasa,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />diekye Yaa diɛtɔɔ ninumbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">ee atɔɔ lɛsaatofo nwaa lewo.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Kafɔɔ nse eefukuti selonkoo nɔɔ alɛ ootoso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">am-ma pɔnkɔ ku siɛtɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />“Afɔ niɛta pɔnkɔ osie nɔɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">ee feetĩi simu nɔɔ kamaa ku sinwini?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Afɔ nintɔɔ an-yefe fɛle letroee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">fanta difu mpɛ nwɔ ku lɛkanta nɔɔ onwu ɔkpa nwu?<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Anfuu kasɔ ku osie, an-nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di osie nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">anlolaa suoto antaka kakpɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Am-ma lɛyɛkɛ, annyɛkɛ lɛsalɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">sinunsɔ ninkpɛ nwɔ di kapamii suoto.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Kɔtaa nfifielesa ɔfankyi nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">lɛkplɔ kafɔɔ nlɔlɔfɔ nwɔ ninfe.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Anfuu kasɔ di suoto lɛyɔɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">annfuo oyila kloklo nse dikyukyoo lɛfɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Di dikyukyoo kanya didie, ambuɛ alɛ, ‘Ɛhɛ̃ɛ!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">An-nu kakpɛ ofũfũ di kakyonkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ lɛfaa ku kakpɛ kaku.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />“Kakyɛ nflɛlɛtɛ di ninumbe lɛfɔ kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">anfukuti afoko nɔɔ ankyɔɔ kala-kasɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Di kanya lɛfɔ didiki di klikpo nflɛlɛtɛ ansifi osi fanfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">annaabla leyo nɔɔ di katakalekɔ nwu?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ ninle katakalekɔ osi, nfa ansiɛ ku kakyɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">afuɔ sɛkyɛɛfɛ sebo ninle kawofakɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Nfa andie anaamiɛ alesaa nɔɔ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">anu nɔɔ ntofo nya di kakyonkɔ.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Abi nɔɔ nkonko di ntɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">nfũ kafɔɔ beelo ni babɔkɛɛ yi, nfa anwɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lakple Aadiki Yob Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yob alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Nnwɔ nikɔnanfiko ni Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni ɔlaa kamalolaa nwɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Ta nnwɔ nikɔtɛ ni Yaa kolo adiki nwɔ kanya nfɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya aatɔkɔ SAATE nwu alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Ninsiɛko- lɛ nfɛ di ami kadiki fɔ kanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Kɔnɛɛ nii letika di kanya nii.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Ninwii lakakatɛ, kafɔɔ kanya didiki nnaa mi-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">lɛkakatɛ lɛnyɔfa, kafɔɔ namasinkakatɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakakatɛko Yob di kakitikɔ kamɛ alɛ: <verse eid="JOB 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />“Yila kpinkpĩ fɛle osuɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">kamakaalɛ fɔ ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">faadiki mi kanya.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />“Fɔɔtɛ lɛka tinini nii kaasɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">Foolo mi lɛpɔɔ, fanta suoto lɛfɔ lɛbɛ?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Fakpe kɔnɛɛ fɛle Yaa kole okle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">sɛlɔ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ kafuo okpududuu fɛle sele nwɔ?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Ni yɔ dibu ku sɛlɛ fata suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">faakpee suoto lɛfɔ dibu ku akasaa.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Diki ɔblɔ lɛfɔ yakayaka nwu fatuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">nyu otii biala ninkanta ni, faawakosa nwɔ kasɔ,<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />nyu otii biala ninkanta ni faawakosa nwɔ kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">bibiɛ batii kpile nwu di nfũ bayɛ ni.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Siisa bamuu lɛma fakookaa di kudu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">tĩi anu lɛma di ɔkya kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Ni ami omu kamafũ nkpee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">nlɛ koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ kumu kafuo fɔ nkpa ofũ.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />“Nyu lekpo kamɛ bɔkɛɛ kplɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">lɛbla nwɔ ni ku afɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">anwee ni sɛfa fɛle nankyue.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Ɔnyɛɛ wɔ akpe ni di kataduu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">ku osie wɔ ninsi ni di kafutu nɔɔ sina kamɛ!<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Ɔkà nɔɔ nwanwanyi fɛle kowoso ko manlɛɛ ni sida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">beeloso atĩ nɔɔ sikũ bɛɛkyasa.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Akufi nɔɔ nle fɛle kupa wɔ di situu nte nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">nkpaa nɔɔ akufi kafɔɔ fɛle abɔɔsaa sewoso.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Nnwɔɔ ninle ɔkasale di Yaa asaa ya aabla ni kamɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">kafɔɔ Blatɛ nɔɔ kafuo nwɔ ɔkyɛ ɔkyɛ ku kapamii nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Anwɛ alesaa ankyeko akpenkpe osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ kafɔɔ nkpee kɔkyɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ ninya.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Anklɛ ante di lekpo sɛfa kalɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">anwofa di lɛnwaakɛ kamɛ di lɛfɔ.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Lekpo sɛfa dibùu nwu ntĩi nwɔ di kunyii lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">awoso kaanale di okle-lɔɔkɔ lɛmana nwɔ eekyi.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Nse okle kɔkpɛ osie kanya yi, difu nimpɛ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">kuntɛ Yordan okle leyii kuɔbadu kanya nɔɔ yi, andiki atoko ansiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Otii owo kafuo nwɔ omufũ ninnu dituɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">ee antɛ nwɔ okũ andufu onwu nɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />“Fabafuo lefiatan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kansaanwu kplɛ kule di lekpo kamɛ</char></note> odiki ku dadiwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">ee fanii ɔkplalomii nɔɔ ku okũ fantɛ?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Faafuo okũ ɔyɔ otũ ofenko di onwu nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">ee fandufu kayɛɛ nɔɔ ku dadiwa?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Abakple antootikiti fɔ lekoto alɛ nyɔɔ nyaami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Abakakatɛko fɔ ku sɛlɔ buɛɛ?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Ababla kanya ninii ku afɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">alɛ afɔ fafũ nwɔ fɛ ɔlanle lɛfɔ di nkpa nɔɔ mmuu kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Faafuo nwɔ ɔbla fɛle kansiɛ wɔ beese ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">ee fankpee nwɔ kɔnyɛnɛ fanta basankobi lɛfɔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Asaabasunsũtɛ kamafuo nwɔ ɔkyɛlɛnsa ofũ lɛsaa bamba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Babasɛ nwɔ manta di asaabayatɛ kamɛ?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Faafuo ɔkyɔɛ ɔyɔ odufu suoto kukũ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">ee fadufu disi nɔɔ ku lɛkplɔ le mantofo ni kɔkpaku?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Nse fɛɛyɔ kɔnɛɛ feetika nwɔ di suoto yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">fabatofo mmle abatũkunsa fɔ nii, diidii kafɔɔ flɔbasinkple fabla!<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Akpakpa falɛ foomufũ nwɔ, sɛlaa sile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ɔnya nɔɔ lete nle lɛyɛkɛsaa.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Sɛkambi otii kuonwii nnaa abafuo nwɔ ni otũkunsa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">Ni owe nfɛ nikafuo ɔtaka oyila mi di suoto?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Owe ninkpe ɔlaa di suoto nii, alɛ dikpeni lɛta koto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Lɛsaa biala di kolo kalɔ ale mi ale.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />“Namadiɛ ɔkakatɛ di nkpaa nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">osie nɔɔ ku mmle di letembi nɔɔ kɔlɛ ni onyu.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Owe nimafuo osi akpeele nɔɔ odiki ɔtɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Owe nimatɛɛtɛɛ nwɔ ku pɔnkɔ disiɛsaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Owe dikle okɔnsɔ ambɛ nwɔ kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">an-nyu anyɛɛ yɛkɛle nwu anfenko?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Kubiafunsaa sèle ntika di kamaa nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">beetika nya baawo kpinkpĩ;<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />dibiala lɛtɛ dikaako lewo nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">alɛ kɔfɛɛfɔ dilaabuo di obo lɛma.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Bɛɛkyasa nya di bawo suoto kpinkpĩ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">bakaa baawo, nioso blaafuo ɔblá.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Osiɛntɛ nɔɔ mmunaa ɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">anu nɔɔ nsesee fɛle olesɛ kufĩ.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Ɔtɔ sɛkplalomii ndie sinkye kanya nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">atɔmbula nkpakpaa ante.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Kɔyɔ n-fɛ di anwunfie nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">fɛ mmle kundie ni di dibukii le nikofuu ni di sekpoku ɔtɔ kalɔ.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Owiidi nɔɔ nkpee akaa ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">ɔtɔ abembe ndie ankye kanya nɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Osie nsi di simu nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">difu ninleko nwɔ katũ.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Suoto sina nɔɔ abɔtɔ lɛkya kpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">site kekleke sinamakpa nii.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Lɛkankpɛɛ nɔɔ nkpe osie fɛ difuɔnkpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">dikpe osie fɛ okuɔlɛ.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Nse ɛɛtaka eeyila, basientɛ n-yɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">mankple nkpaamaa fiɛ andiki kɔkpaa.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Kapamii ee lɛkplɔ ee ɔkyɔɛ ee lɛkplɔ kaanale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">le nindu nwɔ ni nimbla nwɔ lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />An-nya lɛbɔɔsa fɛle ɔpɛmii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">kupa kafɔɔ fɛle owoso buule.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Kɔtaa ninntɔɔ aatoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">kutiabi nte nwɔ fɛle sɛsɔ.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Kawosoku nte nwɔ fɛle ɔpɛmii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">akplɔ diwi sɛlɔ ntɔɔ am-ma.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Kafutusɔ nɔɔ nle dibukii nkyɛ blɛblɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">andiɛ nnafukpaa antika di apatapta kamɛ fɛle kakpaa.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Anta nkyofokɔ nfuu fɛle ɔkakutu wɔ ninkofuu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">ambakaa lekpo fɛle nnɔnyi nikofuu di dibukii kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Andiɛ osuku wɔ ninsesee ni antɛ sĩ sɛɛmaa nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">otii owo kamanyu alɛ kakyofokɔ nwu nkpe sinwini fututu.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii kaasɔ suoto diɛkyɛkyɛ ku nnwɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">bɔkɛɛ wɔ ninanyɛkɛ nii.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />An-nyu mba ninkanta ni bamuu nyakatãa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">nnwɔɔ ninle ɔka di mba bamuu ninkanta ni suoto nɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Ninfɛ di Yob ladiki kanya aatɔkɔ SAATE nwu alɛ:<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“N-ye nlɛ faafuo asaa amuu ɔbla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">kuonwii dilaafuo kɔkpaa lɛfɔ didiki ɔlalaasa.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Faakaalɛ falɛ, ‘Owe ninle nnwɔ nintĩi ni kɔkà nii osuku alɛ lɛsaatofo diesi ni?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Nwaako, lakakatɛ di asaa ya suoto ntanu ni kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">asaa ya niasii ni ɔkpɛ ɔbla ɔtɛɛ ni, alɛ katofo nii.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />“Faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Kanunua nu, kamakakatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">kamakaalɛ fɔ ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">ni fabadiki kanya.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Atoko nii ntoonu lɛkpanko lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">kafɔɔ kanunua anu nii ntɔɔnya fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Nioso lekyidi suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">lekyisa nkpa di kudu ku ntɔ̀ kamɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛkakatɛ Yɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Yob sɛlaa se mmle kamaa, ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Elifas, Teman otii nwu alɛ, “Ɔblɔ kɔfiɛ mi di afɔ ku basiɛwo lɛfɔ banyɔ nwu suoto. Diekye bitakakatɛ ɔlaa biene di suoto nii, fɛ mmle di kpɛmblatɛ nii Yob labla nii. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Nioso biyɔ banankyue bakuɛnsĩ ku akunumuu akuɛnsĩ, biɛkyɛ kpɛmblatɛ nii Yob nfũ biɛlaata ofiɛ asaaɔta bita suoto lee. Kpɛmblatɛ nii Yob kamapɛ ɔlaa anta ye, ami kafɔɔ kamafũ ɔlaa ɔpɛ nɔɔ, alɛ naananfi ye kootoko di sibuu lee nwu kanya. Bitakakatɛ ɔlaa biene di suoto nii fɛ mmle di kpɛmblatɛ nii Yob labla nii.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Nioso Elifas, Teman otii nwu, Bildad, Suhi otii nwu ku Sofa, Naama otii nwu labla fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ma nii; ni di SAATE nwu lafũ Yob ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta nwu nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Di Yob lapɛ ɔlaa aata ni basiɛwo nɔɔ nwu aaloo ni sɛmaa, SAATE nwu lakple aabla Yob saawɛntɛ, ni aatɔɔ asaa ya niawɛ nwɔ ni saa di akyuu anyɔ kanya nɛ. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Babilɛma-suɔtɔbi ku babilɛma-sankobi bamuu ku otii biala niatofo nwɔ ni saa, lawa baabaleko nwɔ alesaa di leyo nɔɔ. Baatɔɔ yɔɔsa, baakpee nwɔ kɔnɛɛ kaafutu di dibuo nimuu di SAATE nwu lata diawa nwɔ ni di suoto. Obiala lɛma latɔɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle lɛkɔnii.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />SAATE nwu lawii Yob lɛtɔtrɔ aalenkee lɛkasale nwu di nkpa nɔɔ osiɛ bule kamɛ. Aawɛ bafoso lefosi-nkpe-nna, kapu bapɔnkɔ nkpe nkuɔ, banankyue-suɔtɔ ba nimbla ni ɔkpɛ di afe kakpe kanwii ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo kakpe kanwii. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Aawɛ kafɔɔ babisuɔtɔbi bakuɛnsĩ ku babisankobi batiɛ. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Aatika obisankobi kasale leyooto alɛ, Yemima, ɔnyɔɔfa Kesia, otiɛfa kafɔɔ Keren-Hapuk. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Kakɔkaakɔ ditawɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto di basanko lawɛ baalɛ ni sekpeele fɛ Yob babisankobi nwu. Ote lɛma kafɔɔ lata ma atesaa manko babilɛma-suɔtɔbi.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Di n-ya mmle sɛmaa, Yob lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ kɔlafa-afosi-ana; aanya babi nɔɔ ku babi lɛma dialaadu kɔna naafa. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Nioso Yob labe nwaa, aakpi di sɛnɔɔfo kamɛ.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>